			<personalityDescription>Wilford&apos;s enjoyment of conflict goes far beyond strategy or skill. There&apos;s a gleam in his eye whenever someone else is hurting, a twisted satisfaction in knowing that the suffering is entirely his doing. Wilford has a sharp mind and a quick understanding of how things work. Whether it&apos;s battlefield tactics, business deals, or reading people, he picks up on the important details fast and uses them to his advantage. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Finds pleasure in cruelty. Hurt is the goal, not the side effect.&lt;br&gt;- Learns fast, strikes faster - sees the angles most miss.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
