			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in Tami&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. Mid-battle, mid-debrief, mid-anything, Tami will fire off a quick finger gun with a cocky grin. &quot;We got this.&quot; Somehow, it works - her lance actually feels a little steadier. Maybe it&apos;s the certainty. Maybe it&apos;s the absurdity. Either way, it helps. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
