			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Everything grates on him - people, orders, even the sound of his own comms. Alex is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who he is, his temper is a fuse ready to blow. Alex isn&apos;t fearless - he&apos;s terrified of being just another warrior lost to history. He fights like he has something to prove, because if he doesn&apos;t, then what was the point? When someone doubts him, he takes it personally. &quot;You think I won&apos;t make it? That&apos;s fine. I&apos;ll prove you wrong - or die trying.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
