			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Berta is the rock they lean on. She doesn&apos;t just stand her ground - she inspires others to do the same, proving that true strength comes from never backing down, no matter how impossible the fight may seem. Berta&apos;s energy is contagious. She has a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
