			<personalityDescription>Bob is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. His tactics shift constantly, his decisions keep enemies guessing, and his sheer momentum makes him nearly impossible to stop once he sets his sights on something. Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Bob. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining his gear, or following through on commitments, he tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable, high-pressure operator - don&apos;t get in their way.&lt;br&gt;- Needs a babysitter, not a command.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
