			<personalityDescription>Philippe doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action he takes is calculated to serve his own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. Philippe pushes forward relentlessly, not just because he enjoys combat, but because slowing down means thinking. And thinking means acknowledging just how much this war has taken from him. </personalityDescription>
