			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Lietgarda never sits back and lets events unfold - she&apos;s always moving, always planning, always ensuring she&apos;s the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. Lietgarda refuses to let her fights be just another skirmish. She&apos;s seen too many battles blend together, too many victories that feel hollow. If she&apos;s going to fight, then the ending better damn well be worth it. &quot;If this is going to be another day of war, I&apos;m going to make sure the last second actually matters.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to sit back. Takes the wheel, writes the outcome.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
