			<personalityDescription>Olivera will do whatever it takes to survive and profit. She switches sides when the money&apos;s right, abandons allies if the deal goes sour, and never lets sentiment get in the way of a paycheck. If someone wants loyalty, they&apos;d better pay extra. Olivera isn&apos;t obvious about it, but any time someone accidentally brushes against her, claps her on the back, or leans in too close, her body reacts before she does. &quot;Nothing&apos;s wrong. Just - don&apos;t do that again.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Switches sides mid-fight if the payout shifts. Not to be trusted without a signed contract.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
