			<personalityDescription>Tony knows hesitation gets people killed. They act fast, takes risks, and make hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In their mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. Tony eats because it&apos;s routine. Because it&apos;s something normal in a world that isn&apos;t. Because if they focus on unwrapping a snack, just for a moment, it&apos;s not about the bodies, the losses, the blood. It&apos;s just food. And if they stop? They might start feeling everything else. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves fast. Makes the call before anyone else dares.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
