			<personalityDescription>To La-Ohn, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. She dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In her world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. La-Ohn doesn&apos;t just do things - she masters them. Her skill and precision make even the most complex tasks seem simple, setting her apart as someone who truly knows her craft. </personalityDescription>
