			<personalityDescription>Yvette doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer her something in return. Her survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Yvette has no patience for discussions from across a room. She closes distance, gets right in front of whoever she&apos;s talking to, and makes sure they feel the weight of her words. It&apos;s not aggression - it&apos;s just how she operates. But people definitely take it that way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t benefit them, they&apos;re not interested - period.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
