			<personalityDescription>Joshua&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. They can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what they want. No matter how bleak things get, Joshua refuses to let doubt take hold. They remind their unit why they fight, why they push forward, and why they can&apos;t afford to give up - because in their mind, defeat is only a state of mind. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Born dealmaker. If they&apos;re smiling, you&apos;ve already lost something.&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to let despair settle in. Might be the reason the line holds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
