			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Lynn&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. Lynn is a natural at what she does. Whether it&apos;s piloting, strategy, or problem-solving, she picks things up quickly and executes with precision, making even the most difficult tasks look effortless. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;br&gt;- Natural talent - makes hard jobs look routine.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
