			<personalityDescription>Yekaterina sees through people like glass. She picks apart their motives, exploits their weaknesses, and predicts their actions before they even realize what they&apos;re going to do. It&apos;s not empathy - it&apos;s just another tool for survival. Yekaterina thrives in the chaos of war, treating every mission as a personal challenge. The more dangerous the objective, the bigger her grin. &quot;Oh, this is a bad idea? Good. That makes it more fun.&quot; </personalityDescription>
