			<personalityDescription>Donna carries a permanent chip on their shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving they won. Donna never sits back and lets events unfold - they&apos;re always moving, always planning, always ensuring they&apos;re the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries resentment like armor. Needs to win, no matter the cost.&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to sit back. Takes the wheel, writes the outcome.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
