			<personalityDescription>Mohan acts first and deals with the consequences later. He thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Mohan doesn&apos;t just stand beside his allies - he lifts them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, he ensures that no one fights alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Instinct-driven. Bold or foolish - depends on the day. Decisive, not always smart.&lt;br&gt;- Covers your six without being asked. Carries more than their weight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
