			<personalityDescription>Augustina knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. Augustina has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply her presence, she reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, but never pulls weight - others carry the burden.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
