			<personalityDescription>Me-Jeong doesn&apos;t just want to prove herself - she needs to. She throws herself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show she&apos;s worthy of something bigger. No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Me-Jeong tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. She refuses to play politics or pretend to be something she isn&apos;t, even if it makes her enemies. </personalityDescription>
