			<personalityDescription>Hayden treats the impossible like an invitation. He never slows down, never looks back, and never lets fear dictate his choices - because, to him, fear is just an excuse he refuses to entertain. Hayden sees every situation as a business opportunity. If there&apos;s money to be made, he&apos;s already working the angles, cutting deals, and making sure he walks away with the biggest share - preferably at someone else&apos;s expense. </personalityDescription>
