			<personalityDescription>Kareem rarely entertains arguments or second opinions - he&apos;s already made up his mind. When others try to offer input, he waves them off with a sigh or a curt reply, making it clear he doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense. Kareem isn&apos;t a MedTech, but MedTechs don&apos;t always arrive. He&apos;s seen too many warriors bleed out because no one knew what to do. So he learned. And now, whether it&apos;s his job or not, he&apos;ll make sure at least one more person makes it out alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t take input - just cuts people off and moves on like their words don&apos;t matter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
