			<personalityDescription>Ruby isn&apos;t just smart - she understands why people do what they do. She offers sharp observations, unexpected wisdom, and just the right words to make others think twice. Whether leading or advising, her insight makes her a valuable ally. Ruby has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect her. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to her, it&apos;s all just noise. She does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 36%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows what drives people - and how to use it. Dangerous in the right seat.&lt;br&gt;- Sees war as noise. Filters everything but orders.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
