			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Afshan&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. No matter the task Afshan refuses to call something finished until it meets her impossibly high standards. &quot;It&apos;s fine,&quot; someone tells her. &quot;No,&quot; she replies, making one last adjustment. &quot;It&apos;s correct.&quot; The rest of the team has learned to let her work - because once she&apos;s satisfied, the job is done right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
