			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Sae-Nah, the kind that makes people listen when she speaks and follow when she leads. She doesn&apos;t need to prove herself - she already knows where she stands. Sae-Nah keeps everything - ammo, supplies, spare parts - because you never know when you&apos;ll need them. She refuses to let go of anything useful, even if it means stockpiling more than she could ever realistically use. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t posture - just leads. Speaks, and others follow without question.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps everything that isn&apos;t nailed down. Doesn&apos;t share. Doesn&apos;t trust.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
