			<personalityDescription>Jayden plays the long game, outmaneuvering competitors before they even realize there&apos;s a game being played. They make alliances when they serve their goals, break them when they don&apos;t, and never loses sight of the bigger picture - their rise to the top. Jayden doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, they&apos;re already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
