			<personalityDescription>Pain is just another weapon in Gilar&apos;s arsenal, and he wield it with ruthless precision. He doesn&apos;t rush to end a fight; he draws it out, savoring every moment of his opponent&apos;s fear and despair. Gilar doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, he&apos;s already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
