			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Hanne&apos;s strong suit. They follow instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate their path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, they never hesitates. Hanne has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply their presence, they remind people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy ignored. Runs on instinct and adrenaline. Sometimes lucky, always fast.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
