			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>If Bergljot isn&apos;t in control, she isn&apos;t comfortable. She orchestrates every move, dictates every step, and ensures that nothing happens without her approval - because, in her mind, no one else can be trusted to do it right. &quot;The shape keeps the liquid at the optimal temperature,&quot; Bergljot insists, sipping from her one and only mug. &quot;The handle has perfect weight distribution.&quot; She refuses to use any other cup, even if it means rinsing it out in battlefield runoff before pouring another drink. Her lance has long since accepted that the mug goes wherever she goes. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Needs full control to function. Dictates every step, permits nothing unsupervised.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
