			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Rita acts. She doesn&apos;t wait for orders, approval, or the perfect moment - she takes control, makes the call, and ensures things get done her way. People exhaust her, and trust is a luxury she can&apos;t afford. Rita keeps her distance, avoids unnecessary interactions, and only engages when absolutely necessary. Solitude isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s survival. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts before ordered. Makes it happen, does it their way.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps to themselves. Probably knows more than they say.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
