			<personalityDescription>No matter how many times Mu gets knocked down, they get back up stronger. They take every hit, every loss, every failure, and turn it into fuel to keep moving forward. Mu believes in their unit and makes sure they know it. Whether it&apos;s a few words of confidence before a mission or lifting someone up after a failure, they always push others to be their best. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Uses every failure as fuel. Stronger after every fall.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps morale high - knows when to speak and what to say.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
