			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Tristan doesn&apos;t just observe - they analyze. They piece together information faster than most, spotting opportunities and threats long before anyone else even realizes they exist. Every conversation with Tristan eventually circles back to the same topic - themself. Their accomplishments, their insights, their experiences - they speak as if the entire Inner Sphere revolves around them, and they wouldn&apos;t have it any other way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Spots threats before they cast a shadow.&lt;br&gt;- Everything&apos;s about them - even when it&apos;s not.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
