			<personalityDescription>Felicidade has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. She quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making her a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. There could be an emergency, a full company deployment, a reactor on fire - but Felicidade will not start work without drinking from her one mug. &quot;Things function better with consistency,&quot; she says, taking another sip. The fact that she talks about her mug the same way she talks about people is concerning. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through noise - grabs the signal before anyone else hears it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
