			<personalityDescription>Serafina is convinced she&apos;s the best warrior, the best tactician, and probably the smartest person in the room. She doesn&apos;t just believe in herself - she assumes everyone else is playing catch-up, whether they realize it or not. Serafina&apos;s coworkers have stopped letting her carry anything important. She knows why, but she doesn&apos;t complain. She&apos;s learned to stick to simple tasks - at least until she trips over a chair and she sends a clipboard flying. &quot;It&apos;s fine. Nothing important broke this time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Assumes superiority in everything. Believes others are just trying to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
