			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Cora&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. Cora doesn&apos;t just lead - she elevates those around her. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, she makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
