			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Elek&apos;s strengths. He speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then he considers himself a saint. Elek doesn&apos;t just track time - he dreads it. Every mission is another countdown, every day is another mark closer to an inevitable, unspoken deadline. He schedules things not because he likes order, but because he&apos;s terrified of how little control anyone really has. </personalityDescription>
