			<personalityDescription>Khaalida doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only what works. She lies, cheats, and betrays without hesitation, using people as stepping stones on her path to power. If someone trusted her, they&apos;ve already made their last mistake. Khaalida latches onto a topic with desperation. She throws herself into technical specs, tactics, anything that keeps her mind from wandering. She knows if she stops  thinking about this, she&apos;ll start thinking about everything else - the battles she&apos;s lost, the friends who never made it back, the creeping realization that the fighting never really ends. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 75%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty? Ethics? Dead weight. Uses people like tools.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
