			<personalityDescription>Maybel doesn&apos;t just look down on others - she barely acknowledges them. She sees herself as superior in every way, treating allies as tools and enemies as annoyances. If someone disagrees with her, it&apos;s because they&apos;re too stupid to understand why she&apos;s right. Maybel refuses to stand still, her mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. Her adaptability keeps her one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Barely acknowledges teammates. Sees people as tools or distractions.&lt;br&gt;- Brains always five moves ahead - can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
