			<personalityDescription>Diet doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - she makes the call and expects others to keep up. Diet isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. Patience has never been Diet&apos;s strong suit. She leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, her restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - she lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes fast calls. Efficient, not rude. Tactical clarity is priority.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
