			<personalityDescription>Štepánka doesn&apos;t just move - she propels herself forward with unstoppable energy. She thrives in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. Štepánka isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. She doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond her own survival. If someone expects her to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Built for chaos - turns speed into a weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
