			<personalityDescription>Érico always pushes for more than he can realistically handle. Whether it&apos;s taking on impossible missions, making reckless bets, or biting off more than he can chew, he refuses to accept his limits - often to his own detriment. Érico says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bites off more than they can shoot. Leaves cleanup for the rest of us.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
