			<personalityDescription>Dennis doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. He keeps his eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull him off course. Dennis always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. He might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move has purpose. Won&apos;t tolerate drift or distraction.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
