			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Sameera has a knack for finding common ground, turning tense situations into opportunities. Whether negotiating a ceasefire or keeping a lance from falling apart, they know the right words can be as powerful as a loaded autocannon. There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Sameera. They grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if they stop moving, they might have to face what they&apos;ve lost along the way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- De-escalates tension. Keeps lances together. Words used like weapons.&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
