			<personalityDescription>Lin-Sha brings an infectious energy to everything she does. She&apos;s the first to charge into battle, the last to leave the bar, and somehow always has the stamina for one more round - whether it&apos;s a firefight or a drinking contest. Lin-Sha has a habit of stretching the truth - sometimes a little, sometimes a lot. Whether it&apos;s exaggerating her accomplishments, fudging numbers, or making promises she can&apos;t keep, she always finds a way to make herself look better than she really is. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brings fire to everything. Fights hard, parties harder, never fades.&lt;br&gt;- Shines up mediocrity like it&apos;s gold - good at making nothing sound impressive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
