			<personalityDescription>Ansansa doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, he&apos;ll do it his way - whether anyone asked for his help or not. Ansansa doesn&apos;t just see the game being played - he plays it better than everyone else. He spots weaknesses, exploits blind spots, and reads people like open books. By the time others realize they&apos;ve been outmaneuvered, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
