			<personalityDescription>To Jun, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He demands obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to his will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Jun refuses to accept anything less than perfection. He puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, he&apos;s ready for anything. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Controls through pressure or intimidation. Weakness is punished.&lt;br&gt;- Demands excellence. Prepares until theres no room for error.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
