			<personalityDescription>Fear died a long time ago for Ludwik. He walks through hell with a steady hand, not because he doesn&apos;t understand the danger, but because he refuses to let it matter. If death comes, Ludwik will meet it head-on. Ludwik believes he&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against him, he refuses to stop striving for the future he knows he can reach. </personalityDescription>
