			<personalityDescription>Kiira has never met a fight they didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, they run on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Quick-thinking and perceptive, Kiira sees the angles others miss. Whether they&apos;re navigating a battlefield or a negotiation, their ability to read the room and adjust makes them a force to be reckoned with. </personalityDescription>
