			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Paul chases every high, every challenge, every risk like he&apos;s possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, he can&apos;t stop himself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment he slows down, he gets bored. And that is unacceptable. Paul&apos;s calendar isn&apos;t just for logistics; it&apos;s full of birthdays, contract anniversaries, and even the day he first met each member of his lance. He makes sure to slip a small gift or a kind word to comrades on their special days. Some find it endearing, others unsettling - because in this line of work, remembering dates also means remembering who didn&apos;t make it to the next one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
