			<personalityDescription>Leslie doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets her more. She plays on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Leslie is the one who profits most. Leslie thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. She&apos;s impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but her. </personalityDescription>
