			<personalityDescription>Pui-man sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. She takes what she needs, wrings every ounce of value out of those around her, and discards them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. While she doesn&apos;t seek attention, Pui-man notices everything. She listens more than she speaks, analyzes before she acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. Her quiet nature makes her words all the more impactful when she chooses to share them. </personalityDescription>
