			<personalityDescription>Antje isn&apos;t just tough - she&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage her, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow her down. She keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. Antje doesn&apos;t just analyze because she wants to - she does it because she has to. She&apos;s seen one overlooked detail turn into disaster. She reviews everything because she knows somewhere in the data is the difference between living and dying next time. </personalityDescription>
