			<personalityDescription>No task is too small, no detail too minor for Dabir to overlook. They work tirelessly, knowing that success isn&apos;t about talent alone - it&apos;s about dedication, preparation, and an unwillingness to settle for mediocrity. Dabir can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. They spin stories, plays up their credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, they&apos;re long gone. </personalityDescription>
