			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Milton - it&apos;s an obsession. He sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in his relentless pursuit of fortune. Milton sees himself as the main character in every situation. Others are just supporting cast - useful when they prop him up, disposable when they don&apos;t. His confidence is unwavering, even when reality doesn&apos;t quite match his self-image. </personalityDescription>
