			<personalityDescription>Donni refuses to stand still, their mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. Their adaptability keeps them one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. Donni doesn&apos;t listen to music because they enjoy it. They listen because if they don&apos;t, the silence creeps in - the echoes of artillery, the screams over comms, the last words of people who didn&apos;t make it. The headphones aren&apos;t just habit. They&apos;re survival. </personalityDescription>
