			<personalityDescription>Mike has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In his world, kindness is just another word for weakness. Mike&apos;s voice stays calm and even while everyone else is losing their minds. It doesn&apos;t matter how bad things get - his response is always unshaken, controlled, and matter-of-fact. &quot;Yeah, it&apos;s bad. No, that doesn&apos;t change what we need to do.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds others, not themself. Doesn&apos;t lose sleep.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
