			<personalityDescription>Carla doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. Carla doesn&apos;t waste a single calorie. Every meal is planned, every extra bite stored for later. While others celebrate after a mission with a feast, Carla quietly pockets leftovers. &quot;Might need it later,&quot; she mutters. Her lance jokes about it - until they&apos;re starving behind enemy lines and she&apos;s the only one still eating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
