			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To Dong-kwan, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. They demand obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to their will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Dong-kwan used to wonder why they had to log their every action. Why they had to check in with command even for minor tasks. Why their reports were always cross-checked against surveillance logs. But they stopped asking questions when they saw what happened to the last guy who didn&apos;t follow procedure. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Controls through pressure or intimidation. Weakness is punished.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
