			<personalityDescription>Darlene acts first and deals with the consequences later. She thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Darlene doesn&apos;t just want wealth - she hoards it, exploits others for it, and will do anything to get more. Bribes, backstabbing, and extortion are just tools in her arsenal, and if someone gets in the way of her fortune, they won&apos;t be a problem for long. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Instinct-driven. Bold or foolish - depends on the day. Decisive, not always smart.&lt;br&gt;- Uses people like stepping stones - crushes anyone who slows the climb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
