			<personalityDescription>Roy doesn&apos;t just focus - he fixate. He drills his skills, studies his enemies, and plans every move with relentless intensity. To him, anything less than total commitment is the first step toward failure. There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Roy&apos;s world. He delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, he makes sure they know it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fixates. Trains, studies, plans - every move laser-precise.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
