			<personalityDescription>Tony isn&apos;t just thinking ahead - they&apos;re willing to burn down the present to create the future they envision. They pursue their ideals with relentless conviction, and if others can&apos;t see the brilliance of their plan, they&apos;re just obstacles to be removed. Behind every decision Tony makes, there&apos;s an unseen web of strategy. They set traps with casual conversations, pull strings without anyone noticing, and ensure that when the dust settles, they&apos;re the one left standing. </personalityDescription>
