			<personalityDescription>Gerasim&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. He adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in his favor. Solitude isn&apos;t loneliness for Gerasim - it&apos;s freedom. Free from expectations, from prying eyes, from the constant demand to be something for others. In the quiet, he finds clarity, strength, and the space to think. </personalityDescription>
