			<personalityDescription>Jim thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. He refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing himself and everyone around him past their limits. Jim hates long stretches of nothing. He needs movement, action, some kind of task. When forced to relax, he becomes short-tempered, distracted, always glancing toward the door like he&apos;s waiting to be called back in. &quot;How do people do this? Just... sit here? For hours?&quot; </personalityDescription>
