			<personalityDescription>Deirdra moves through life with absolute certainty, their presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When they speak, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Deirdra always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear they think they&apos;re the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, they have a way of making others feel small without ever raising their voice. </personalityDescription>
