			<personalityDescription>Lien follows a plan to the letter and expects others to do the same. Once she has made a decision, nothing short of disaster - or outright force - will make her change course. Lien&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just her skill, but her ability to think. She sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when she moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows plans rigidly. Won&apos;t adapt unless forced. Expects total conformity.&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
