			<personalityDescription>Joe doesn&apos;t fight out of hatred or ambition - he fights because there&apos;s no  other choice. Every battle is a necessary evil, and every trigger pull is a failure of diplomacy. If he could find another way, he would take it in a heartbeat. Joe always has a target in mind, and he won&apos;t stop until he reaches it. Every move he makes is another step toward his objective, and he doesn&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t get him closer to success. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Only fights when cornered. Views violence as failure, not achievement.&lt;br&gt;- Eyes on the target. Won&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t move the needle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
