			<personalityDescription>Pik-Shan doesn&apos;t just set goals - she demands results. No matter the challenge, no matter the obstacles, she pushes herself relentlessly forward, refusing to accept anything less than success. Whether she&apos;s about to drop, in the repair bay, or riding in a DropShip, Pik-Shan always has her headphones on. Always. No one knows what she&apos;s listening to, but they&apos;re pretty sure she&apos;s ignoring everything else - until it&apos;s time to fight. Then, suddenly, she&apos;s hyper-focused, like the world just synced to her personal rhythm. </personalityDescription>
