			<personalityDescription>Yoshi doesn&apos;t just enjoy passion - he commands it. With a confident smirk and an irresistible charm, he draws others into his orbit, knowing exactly how to fuel the fire of desire and leave them wanting more. Yoshi doesn&apos;t waste time on pretenses. He lives by his own code, unshaken by outside pressure, and refuses to compromise who he is just to fit someone else&apos;s version of how he should be. </personalityDescription>
