			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Abena&apos;s mind. Once she sets her course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make her stray from it. Abena always looks out for number one. If a situation doesn&apos;t benefit her directly, she&apos;s not interested. She&apos;ll work with others when it suits her, but the moment it stops being profitable, she&apos;s already moving on. </personalityDescription>
