			<personalityDescription>Aguostinho always takes charge - whether he should or not. He insists on controlling every situation, making sure everything goes exactly as he wants, even if it means steamrolling everyone else in the process. Solitude isn&apos;t loneliness for Aguostinho - it&apos;s freedom. Free from expectations, from prying eyes, from the constant demand to be something for others. In the quiet, he finds clarity, strength, and the space to think. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes control uninvited. Bulldozes team dynamics to get their way.&lt;br&gt;- Needs space to think. Give it, or lose them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
