			<personalityDescription>Ewald approaches everything with methodical precision. He doesn&apos;t believe in shortcuts or luck - only in putting in the work, refining his craft, and ensuring that he never leaves anything to chance. Ewald is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, he brings an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Methodical and tireless. Trusts hard work over luck every time.&lt;br&gt;- Fast mover - keeps the rest scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
