			<personalityDescription>Everything grates on them - people, orders, even the sound of their own comms. Onfrio is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who they are, their temper is a fuse ready to blow. Onfrio doesn&apos;t hide it. They&apos;ve got custom patches, decals, and even a helmet design that features pointed ears. When someone tries to make it a joke, Onfrio just raises an eyebrow. &quot;Yeah, it&apos;s a fox. Yes, on purpose. Any more questions?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
