			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Kane doesn&apos;t do safe. He thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, he always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Kane didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. He&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. He trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure he&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Not fooled easily. Seen the worst, and learned to profit from it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
