			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Sami is never satisfied - his hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. He devours opportunities, crushes competition, and takes what he wants without hesitation. Sooner or later, even his allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. Sami moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze him - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. He does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will strip allies for parts if they&apos;re the last thing left to take.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt flinch, doesnt linger - just keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
