			<personalityDescription>Janin has an insatiable appetite for life, whether it&apos;s for knowledge, wealth, or victory. They throw themself into everything they do with relentless energy, always hungry for more. Janin drinks because if they don&apos;t, the memories come crawling back. The faces of the dead, the screams over comms, the way burning metal smells just like burning flesh. They&apos;re not drinking to get drunk - they&apos;re drinking to function. The flask is always with them. It has to be. Because the moment it&apos;s empty, the past comes rushing in. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always eating the world alive - never full, never done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
