			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Mu&apos;ayyad has no patience for it. He throws himself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with him. Mu&apos;ayyad doesn&apos;t just give - he gives big. Whether it&apos;s picking up the tab, upgrading a friend&apos;s &apos;Mek, or spreading wealth where it&apos;s needed, he believes that success means nothing if you can&apos;t share it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ignores risk entirely. Bravery or death wish - hard to tell.&lt;br&gt;- Generosity&apos;s big, loud, and hard to miss - keeps spreading the wealth like it&apos;ll never run out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
