			<personalityDescription>Wiwit doesn&apos;t hesitate when faced with the impossible - She meets it head-on, with a steady gaze and an unshakable will. She knows that fear is inevitable, but surrender is a choice. Wiwit&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, she keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Faces the impossible with level focus. Fear acknowledged, never obeyed.&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
