			<personalityDescription>Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Ji-an. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining their gear, or following through on commitments, they tend to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. Ji-an has an uncanny sense for when things are getting too tense. Right before things boil over, they fires off a well-timed finger gun and a grin just wide enough to throw people off. It shouldn&apos;t work - but it does. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Needs a babysitter, not a command.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
