			<personalityDescription>Simbra refuses to quit, no matter the odds. Whether facing superior firepower or an impossible mission, they grit their teeth and pushes forward - because failure is simply not an option. Simbra&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. They don&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. </personalityDescription>
