			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Marius&apos;s eyes. He meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in his way is just another problem to crush. Marius approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. He doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. </personalityDescription>
