			<personalityDescription>Flordeliz has an insatiable appetite for life, whether it&apos;s for knowledge, wealth, or victory. They throw themself into everything they do with relentless energy, always hungry for more. Flordeliz has watched warriors die because they froze up, made a bad call, or simply weren&apos;t prepared. Now, they drill relentlessly - because if they can burn survival into muscle memory, maybe they can save at least a few of them next time. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always eating the world alive - never full, never done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
