			<personalityDescription>Bannon doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, he&apos;s already onto the next big score. Bannon says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t pay, they&apos;re not interested. Efficient, cold, and already gone.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
