			<personalityDescription>For Coreene, war isn&apos;t just about winning - it&apos;s about breaking the enemy in every possible way. She doesn&apos;t just destroy opponents; she makes sure they know exactly how powerless they are before delivering the final blow. To Coreene, every situation is a battlefield, and she plays it like a master tactician. She anticipates actions before they happen, positioning herself for success while others struggle to keep up. </personalityDescription>
