			<personalityDescription>Kristina has an insatiable appetite for life, whether it&apos;s for knowledge, wealth, or victory. They throw themself into everything they do with relentless energy, always hungry for more. Kristina thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. They&apos;re impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but them. </personalityDescription>
