			<personalityDescription>In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Olivie refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. Olivie isn&apos;t the loudest person in the room, but if someone questions her competence, she won&apos;t rest until she proves them wrong. &quot;You said I couldn&apos;t fix this in time? Well, I just did. So what now?&quot; </personalityDescription>
