			<personalityDescription>For Shabeeba, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. She fights like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Shabeeba thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. She&apos;s impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;br&gt;- Luck or instinct - hard to tell, but it works more than it should.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
