			<personalityDescription>For Karunanidhi, hesitation is just another form of failure. He throws himself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, he never slows down. Karunanidhi doesn&apos;t just stand beside his allies - he lifts them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, he ensures that no one fights alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hesitation rejected. Decisions made mid-charge. High risk, high volatility.&lt;br&gt;- Covers your six without being asked. Carries more than their weight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
