			<personalityDescription>Misbaah isn&apos;t interested in quick victories - she&apos;s interested in certain victories. She waits, watches, and maneuvers every piece into place before making her move, ensuring that when the moment comes, her enemies never see it coming. Crowds fuel her. Misbaah enjoys the spotlight, telling the best stories, leading the wildest celebrations, and making sure everyone is having a good time. If there&apos;s action, she&apos;s in the middle of it, keeping the momentum alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Prefers certainty to speed. Strikes only when the board is set.&lt;br&gt;- Turns strangers into comrades before the first drinks gone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
