			<personalityDescription>For Oba, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible she is. She dismisses advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that her skills and luck will always carry her through, no matter the risk. Oba jokes about things that no one should be joking about. Her comrades laugh nervously, but Oba&apos;s grin never quite reaches her eyes. &quot;Oh, that? Yeah, no big deal. Just another day of watching people die.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees every warning as noise. Trusts skill to bail them out - always.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
