			<personalityDescription>In Gabi&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. She seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Gabi doesn&apos;t believe in luck, but she believes in warnings. She&apos;s watched people ignore the signs - only for them to never return. A slight misstep, a broken routine, a bird call at the wrong time - all dismissed, all followed by disaster. She&apos;s done trying to convince others. She just hopes she&apos;s smart enough to listen when it really matters. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees kindness as weakness. Destroys problems before they form.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
