			<personalityDescription>Every situation is a potential fight in Joe&apos;s mind. They don&apos;t care if it&apos;s an argument, a rivalry, or a full-scale war - they treat them all the same: something to be won, and preferably in the loudest, most aggressive way possible. Joe says what they mean and means what they say. They don&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - their words and actions come from a place of honesty, making them a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees all conflict as war. Solves everything loud and hard.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
