			<personalityDescription>Ozalan&apos;s generosity isn&apos;t just about giving - it&apos;s about ensuring others have what they need. Whether he&apos;s sacrificing his own comfort, pulling strings to help a friend, or making sure no one is left behind, he never hesitates to step up. Most people aren&apos;t worth Ozalan&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath his notice, he brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 71%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices comfort for crew. Good heart, dangerous habit.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
