			<personalityDescription>Rafiya thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Rafiya simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Rafiya has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. She quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making her a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Momentum addict. Planning seen as weakness. Lets consequences catch up later.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through noise - grabs the signal before anyone else hears it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
