			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Melissa doesn&apos;t just want wealth - she hoards it, exploits others for it, and will do anything to get more. Bribes, backstabbing, and extortion are just tools in her arsenal, and if someone gets in the way of her fortune, they won&apos;t be a problem for long. Melissa eats because it&apos;s routine. Because it&apos;s something normal in a world that isn&apos;t. Because if she focuses on unwrapping a snack, just for a moment, it&apos;s not about the bodies, the losses, the blood. It&apos;s just food. And if she stops? She might start feeling everything else. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Uses people like stepping stones - crushes anyone who slows the climb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
