			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Jörg has no patience for it. He throws himself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with him. There&apos;s no telling what Jörg will do next, and that&apos;s what makes him dangerous. His moods swing wildly, his plans shift without warning, and his reactions can be as destructive to his allies as they are to his enemies. </personalityDescription>
