			<personalityDescription>Karla views war as a puzzle, and people as pieces to be moved. Emotions don&apos;t factor into her decisions - only efficiency and effectiveness. If sacrificing a few pawns guarantees her success, she won&apos;t hesitate to make the call. Keeping up with details isn&apos;t a priority for Karla. She does the bare minimum to get by, leaving others to pick up the slack. Whether it&apos;s out of laziness or indifference, she rarely follows through unless it directly benefits her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cold-blooded tactician. Will trade lives like poker chips.&lt;br&gt;- Bare minimum effort. Team carries the rest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
