			<personalityDescription>Lorenzo struts through every situation with an air of undeniable superiority, convinced that his mere presence guarantees victory. His self-assurance borders on arrogance, leaving little room for any doubts - even when caution would be wise. Lorenzo isn&apos;t just skilled - he&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake he won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Lorenzo&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping him alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes presence alone guarantees victory. Confidence smothers caution.&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
