			<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Balistha simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, They refuse to take a step back when it matters most. Need extra ammo? Balistha already packed it. Medkit? Right here. Contingency for if the mission inevitably goes sideways? They&apos;ve got a plan. Their lance has learned that if Balistha tells them to carry an extra power cell, they don&apos;t ask why - they just do it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stubborn courage. Holds ground when others retreat. Reliable in critical moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
