			<personalityDescription>Ivor doesn&apos;t entertain the idea of failure. Whether it&apos;s natural talent, unbreakable will, or sheer force of personality, he carries himself like someone who expects to win - and usually does. Ivor doesn&apos;t just fight - he creates. Every shot, every maneuver, every strike is deliberate, practiced, and flawless. &quot;Anyone can pull a trigger. A real warrior makes it look good.&quot; </personalityDescription>
