			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, even death - none of it matters. Elizabeth will see her mission through to the bitter end, no matter the cost. Stubbornness and sheer willpower keep her standing long after others have fallen. Elizabeth thrives in the chaos of war, treating every mission as a personal challenge. The more dangerous the objective, the bigger her grin. &quot;Oh, this is a bad idea? Good. That makes it more fun.&quot; </personalityDescription>
