			<personalityDescription>Some people call it grit, others call it madness, but Kharlampiy doesn&apos;t care what they think. No matter how much the world tries to grind him down, he keeps going, long after anyone else would have quit. Kharlampiy doesn&apos;t just keep up - he stays ahead. He spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grit or madness - hard to tell. Doesn&apos;t care. Just keeps moving.&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
