			<personalityDescription>Jung-hye doesn&apos;t just give orders - they expect them to be followed, no questions asked. Every battle, every decision, every moment is another chance to prove that only the strongest hand can guide the weak to victory. Jung-hye has a tune for everything. A jaunty whistle during prep, a lazy, off-key melody during downtime, and a slow, eerie note when things get tense. No one knows where they pick their tunes from, but they always seem uncomfortably fitting for the moment. </personalityDescription>
