			<personalityDescription>Massima is convinced she&apos;s the best warrior, the best tactician, and probably the smartest person in the room. She doesn&apos;t just believe in herself - she assumes everyone else is playing catch-up, whether they realize it or not. In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Massima refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Assumes superiority in everything. Believes others are just trying to catch up.&lt;br&gt;- Holds the line on integrity, even when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
