			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Saaliha refuses to be either. She rushes headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Saaliha never stands still. Saaliha is most comfortable in the quiet, away from the noise and chaos of crowded rooms. She doesn&apos;t mind company, but she prefers to keep her circle small - only those she trusts, and even that list is short. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Speed over safety. Bravery or recklessness - depends on the day.&lt;br&gt;- Trust is earned. Rarely given.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
