			<personalityDescription>For Ubaydah, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. They fight like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Ubaydah&apos;s calendar isn&apos;t just personal - it&apos;s the real company schedule. Payroll deadlines, JumpShip departures, contract negotiations - they&apos;ve got it all mapped out. If the commander wants to know when they&apos;re leaving, they don&apos;t ask the XO. They ask Ubaydah. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
