			<personalityDescription>For Vicky, goals aren&apos;t just aspirations - they&apos;re obsessions. She pursues them with single-minded intensity, willing to burn bridges, break rules, and push herself beyond exhaustion if that&apos;s what it takes to achieve victory. Vicky doesn&apos;t just want to prove herself - she needs to. She throws herself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show she&apos;s worthy of something bigger. </personalityDescription>
