			<personalityDescription>For Gary, compromise is just another word for weakness. They stick to their principles, strategies, and orders with unwavering determination, even when logic - or survival - suggests a different path. Gary always has a story about the time they stood their ground against impossible odds. Whether it was charging into fire, refusing to retreat, or staring down a superior force without blinking - they make sure everyone knows about it. &quot;You think this is bad? Let me tell you about the time I...&quot; </personalityDescription>
