			<personalityDescription>Jae-hyun sees everything else as background noise - only the goal in front of them matters. Once they&apos;ve committed to something, nothing short of disaster can pull them away. In a universe full of deception, Jae-hyun is refreshingly straightforward. They say what they mean, do what they promise, and refuse to play games just to gain favor. Their word is one of the few things that can be trusted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Everything but the objective is noise. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s done.&lt;br&gt;- Straight shooter. Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t budge, won&apos;t lie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
