			<personalityDescription>John does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. They aren&apos;t lazy - they just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. John thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. They&apos;re impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but them. </personalityDescription>
