			<personalityDescription>Sam doesn&apos;t just take charge - he demands it. Every situation must unfold according to his design, and he has little patience for anyone who questions his authority. Sam didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. He&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. He trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure he&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. </personalityDescription>
