			<personalityDescription>Mariam wears her confidence like a badge of honor, parading her victories with flair and dismissing setbacks as temporary blips. Her unwavering belief in her own prowess often blinds her to potential dangers, even as she dazzles onlookers with her bold, if misguided, bravado. Mariam doesn&apos;t panic when things go wrong - she adapts. Running low on ammo? She&apos;s already found an alternative. Outnumbered? She&apos;s using the terrain to even the odds. &quot;Doesn&apos;t matter what we have. What matters is how we use it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Flaunts wins, shrugs off losses. Blind spots hidden behind bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
