			<personalityDescription>For Zakaria, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. He fights like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Zakaria has lost people, places, and parts of himself to war, but his personal emblem remains. It&apos;s the one thing he can still control. If that symbol is still standing, then so is he. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
