			<personalityDescription>Once Alfie makes up their mind, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. Plans don&apos;t change, orders don&apos;t get questioned, and they sure as hell aren&apos;t going to admit being  wrong - not now, not ever. Alfie has watched convoy missions go horribly wrong. They&apos;ve seen supply lines torn apart, civilian transports ambushed, key assets lost forever. They take them personally now. &quot;Convoy&apos;s getting through. No matter what. No matter what.&quot; </personalityDescription>
