			<personalityDescription>Zdenka lives in the now, always moving, always deciding on the fly. Whether it&apos;s a split-second gamble or an uncalculated risk, they thrive in the rush of immediate action - consequences can wait. Zdenka never does anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s firepower, preparation, or just sheer intensity, they go all-in, often pushing beyond what&apos;s necessary - or even reasonable. </personalityDescription>
