			<personalityDescription>Viet-Tam charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. He believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Viet-Tam doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - he believes in winning. He bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit his needs, making sure that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the only one left standing. </personalityDescription>
