			<personalityDescription>Glenn walks into every fight like he owns the battlefield, radiating confidence and daring anyone to prove him wrong. Whether it&apos;s leading the charge or taunting an enemy over open comms, he thrives on being the center of attention - and usually has the skills to back it up. Glenn knows that persuasion isn&apos;t just about words - it&apos;s about presence. A well-timed silence, a knowing look, a carefully measured response - all of it works together to make sure, by the end of the conversation, he gets exactly what he wants. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Owns every fight. Loud, showy, competent. Uses confidence as a weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t talk at you - talks through you.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
