			<personalityDescription>Once Colmcilla makes up their mind, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. Plans don&apos;t change, orders don&apos;t get questioned, and they sure as hell aren&apos;t going to admit being  wrong - not now, not ever. Colmcilla doesn&apos;t just want wealth - they hoard it, exploits others for it, and will do anything to get more. Bribes, backstabbing, and extortion are just tools in their arsenal, and if someone gets in the way of their fortune, they won&apos;t be a problem for long. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decisions are final. Won&apos;t revisit, revise, or admit error.&lt;br&gt;- Uses people like stepping stones - crushes anyone who slows the climb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
