			<personalityDescription>Byung-soo carries an air of barely restrained aggression, his words sharp and his patience nonexistent. Every conversation feels like a confrontation and that&apos;s how he likes it. Byung-soo sees war for what it is - a business. He&apos;s a professional, not a hero, and he takes jobs that make sense, get him paid, and keep him alive. He doesn&apos;t fight for glory; he fights to make sure he sees another payday. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 60%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every word a weapon. Conversation feels like combat.&lt;br&gt;- Fights smart, not proud. Prioritizes payday over valor.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
