			<personalityDescription>Duvinse&apos;s tone alone is enough to set people on edge. Whether it&apos;s the slow, deliberate way they correct others or the way they smirk when they struggle, they make it painfully clear that they think they&apos;re leagues ahead of everyone else. Duvinse doesn&apos;t just believe in conspiracies - they&apos;re trying to wake everyone else up. &quot;You think it&apos;s just bad luck? That&apos;s what they want you to think.&quot; They have charts, data, and an alarming amount of unofficial sources to back up their claims. &quot;Wake up, sheeple!&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Even praise feels like punishment. Might make enemies just by talking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
