			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Some people make friends. Conchobarra makes enemies - and seems to prefer it that way. Whether through biting sarcasm or outright aggression, she turns every interaction into a fight waiting to happen, and frankly, Conchobarra wouldn&apos;t have it any other way. Conchobarra is coldly efficient when it comes to mission outcomes. If she has to sacrifice something - or someone - to secure success, she won&apos;t hesitate. It&apos;s not that she doesn&apos;t care - it&apos;s that she knows caring gets in the way. &quot;We finish the mission. We come back alive. Everything else is optional.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes enemies on purpose. Finds comfort in conflict, not camaraderie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
