			<personalityDescription>Mathias doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects them to stick their neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. While they don&apos;t seek attention, Mathias notices everything. They listen more than they speak, analyze before they act, and value deep conversations over shallow chatter. Their quiet nature makes their words all the more impactful when they choose to share them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 35%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;br&gt;- Quiet type. Won&apos;t lead the toast, but will notice who&apos;s missing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
