			<personalityDescription>Once Evanna commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake her resolve once she&apos;s made up her mind. Evanna doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. She weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while she walks away unscathed - and usually richer. </personalityDescription>
