			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Lakshya doesn&apos;t go down easy. Even when the odds are stacked against her, she grits her teeth, digs in, and keeps pushing forward. She&apos;s the kind of fighter who walks out of a wrecked &apos;Mek, bleeding but grinning, ready for round two. Wealth, power, and influence mean little to Lakshya if she can&apos;t use them to help those around her. She sees generosity as more than just kindness - it&apos;s a responsibility, one she takes seriously. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grits teeth, keeps moving. Bleeding, grinning, ready for more.&lt;br&gt;- Treats generosity like duty - takes it as seriously as rank.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
