			<personalityDescription>Ahana doesn&apos;t do safe. She thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, she always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Ahana&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. She doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Pressure builds fast. Don&apos;t let it vent on you.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
