			<personalityDescription>Nick always puts himself first. Whether it&apos;s resources, recognition, or survival, he makes sure he comes out on top - even if it means leaving others behind. Nick has a fact or figure for every situation, whether it&apos;s accuracy rates, survival odds, or enemy engagement trends. He never just trusts intuition. &quot;Statistically speaking, you should already be dead. But hey, keep doing whatever it is you call &apos;strategy.&apos;&quot; </personalityDescription>
