			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as half-measures with Olive. Everything they do is full-throttle, fueled by relentless determination and an unwillingness to accept anything less than total victory. Olive talks about their terrible crime like it&apos;s ancient history, even though it&apos;s clear it&apos;s still eating them alive. Their comrades think they&apos;ve made peace with it - but Olive knows better. &quot;Yeah, I did that. Turns out &apos;sorry&apos; doesn&apos;t fix that kind of mistake.&quot; </personalityDescription>
