			<personalityDescription>Experience has made Milion sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. They read between the lines, recognize hidden motives, and play every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what they are. Milion doesn&apos;t just think something could go wrong - they&apos;re sure of it. &quot;The comms will cut out.&quot; &quot;The terrain is unstable.&quot; &quot;The enemy definitely has backup waiting.&quot; Sometimes they&apos;re right. Sometimes they&apos;re wrong. Either way, they worries enough for the whole squad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads a room like a map - knows where to cut and when.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
