			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Abdul-Jabbar&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as his ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, he indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. Abdul-Jabbar whistles while mounting the DropShip, while advancing through enemy fire, while standing over the wreckage of a downed opponent. It&apos;s never frantic - always slow, steady, calm. His squad isn&apos;t sure if it&apos;s confidence or insanity, but when the whistling stops, they know things have gone very wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 83%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
