			<personalityDescription>Dwayne carries himself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, he radiates a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. While the squad sleeps, Dwayne patrols, cleans his gear, and tweaks his HUD. &quot;Somebody&apos;s gotta be awake,&quot; he says, sipping yet another cup of cold, bitter coffee. He insists it&apos;s not paranoia - he just prefers the quiet, the way the battlefield feels different under starlight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Calm assurance. Inspires teammates, unnerves enemies. Confidence backed by presence.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
