			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Hendrik avoids - it&apos;s something he seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, He meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Hendrik&apos;s mind is a whirlwind of shifting strategies and sudden impulses. Plans rarely survive for more than a moment before he decides to improvise, leaving both allies and enemies scrambling to keep up. </personalityDescription>
