			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Kian tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. They refuse to play politics or pretend to be something they aren&apos;t, even if it makes them enemies. Kian doesn&apos;t just fire their weapon - they track every single shot. &quot;Nine left. Two more reloads. Twenty-three hostiles still moving.&quot; Their squad doesn&apos;t always appreciate the running tally, but when ammo runs low, Kian&apos;s the only one who actually knows how much is left. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Tells the truth even when it hurts. Especially when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
