			<personalityDescription>Huong-Lan doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - she makes the call and expects others to keep up. Huong-Lan isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. To Huong-Lan, control isn&apos;t about leadership - it&apos;s about domination. She micromanages, manipulates, and enforces her will through intimidation or force. If someone steps out of line, they&apos;ll regret it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes fast calls. Efficient, not rude. Tactical clarity is priority.&lt;br&gt;- Leads through domination. Controls through fear, force, or pressure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
