			<personalityDescription>Avajaya believes the best way to handle a crisis is to prevent it before it happens. He stays ahead of the curve, anticipating challenges and solving problems before anyone else even sees them coming. Avajaya doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. He sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if he has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
