			<personalityDescription>Saidah isn&apos;t just skilled - she&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake she won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Saidah&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping her alive. Tactical formations, famous last stands, the lineage of a particular unit - she can recall all of it. One moment she&apos;s breaking down the enemy&apos;s battle doctrine, the next she&apos;s casually mentioning that their insignia has roots in some obscure rebellion from 2434. Most of her comrades don&apos;t mind - unless they&apos;re trying to focus on not dying. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
