			<personalityDescription>Fakhir is the spark that ignites every situation. His charisma, ambition, and relentless drive make him impossible to ignore, drawing people in and pushing events forward with sheer force of will. Fakhir&apos;s always stretching - before a mission, during briefings, even mid-battle. &quot;A stiff body&apos;s a slow body,&quot; he mutters, rolling his shoulders. He treats combat like a sport - one wrong movement, one cramp at the wrong time, and it could cost him his life. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brings heat and motion - people follow whether they mean to or not.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
