			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Abdul-Muttalib&apos;s world. He steps forward without looking back, his decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether he&apos;s right or wrong, he never lingers in uncertainty. Abdul-Muttalib understands that no one has all the answers - not even him. He remains open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. </personalityDescription>
