			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Celine just calls it doing what needs to be done. She doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; she simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Celine&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. She doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 60%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Quiet, relentless persistence. Gets it done or dies trying.&lt;br&gt;- Pressure builds fast. Don&apos;t let it vent on you.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
