			<personalityDescription>To Fraser, restraint is a foreign concept. They surround themself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy their endless cravings - no matter the cost. With a quick joke and a warm smile, Fraser turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. They treat allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. </personalityDescription>
