			<personalityDescription>No matter how hardened the universe tries to make her, Heli refuses to shut herself off from others. She carries their burdens as if they were her own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. Heli doesn&apos;t care about technical readouts or factory settings - she knows when a unit feels right. If she&apos;s forced into something that doesn&apos;t match her, she feels it immediately. &quot;You don&apos;t pick something based on numbers. You feel what belongs to you.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t harden - chooses to feel. Risky, but admirable.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
