			<personalityDescription>Karissa doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. She weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while she walks away unscathed - and usually richer. With a quick joke and a warm smile, Karissa turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. She treats allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Words over weapons. Turns enemies on each other, walks off clean.&lt;br&gt;- Makes friends faster than most make enemies.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
