			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Rayna refuses to be either. She rushes headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Rayna never stands still. Rayna doesn&apos;t intentionally ignore responsibilities - she just gets caught up in her own world. Whether it&apos;s distractions, forgetfulness, or a lack of organization, things tend to slip through the cracks more often than they should. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Speed over safety. Bravery or recklessness - depends on the day.&lt;br&gt;- Forgetful or just doesn&apos;t care - still a liability.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
