			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Ángel&apos;s world. He steps forward without looking back, his decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether he&apos;s right or wrong, he never lingers in uncertainty. Nothing moves Ángel anymore. Loss, suffering, and chaos are just background noise, and he doesn&apos;t waste energy pretending to care. Whether someone lives or dies, wins or loses - it&apos;s all the same in the end. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Watches suffering like it&apos;s weather - present, distant, irrelevant.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
