			<personalityDescription>Janne&apos;s got a talent for finding loopholes, exploiting technicalities, and twisting situations to their advantage. If someone assumed they&apos;d play fair, that&apos;s on them - they never promised to play by the rules. Janne has stopped trying to understand the things they see in their sleep. Vast shapes moving beneath black water, whispers in languages that scrape across their mind, the sense that something is watching them even after they wake. &quot;There&apos;s something down there. And it knows my name.&quot; </personalityDescription>
