			<personalityDescription>Shane moves through life like a storm, always in motion, always pushing forward without a second thought. If there&apos;s a decision to be made, they make it in an instant - hesitation just isn&apos;t in their nature. Shane doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs their skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does their interest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 44%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Storm of action. Decisions made instantly, without pause or regret.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t move unless the C-Bills do. Motivation ends where the payment does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
