			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Yu-zeng doesn&apos;t just chase profits - they extract them. They cut costs, exploit loopholes, and squeeze every last drop out of a deal, no matter who gets shortchanged in the process. If there&apos;s money to be made, morality is just an inconvenience. People trust Yu-zeng because they&apos;re real. They don&apos;t fake emotions, don&apos;t manipulate, and don&apos;t care about putting on an act. Their honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes them both respected and reliable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts corners for profit. If youre in the way, youre the margin.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fake it. Wont break it. Trustworthy to a fault.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
