			<personalityDescription>Rahmania carries herself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, she radiates a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. Rahmania gives entire tactical briefings with just her hands, even when talking would be faster. She insists it&apos;s more efficient - except when it isn&apos;t. Her gestures get more exaggerated the more frustrated she is, until it looks like she&apos;s orchestrating a silent electro-opera. </personalityDescription>
