			<personalityDescription>Andrzej treats every challenge like a war of attrition - they don&apos;t have to be the fastest or the strongest, just the one still standing at the end. And they always are. Andrzej isn&apos;t just skilled - they&apos;re honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake they won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Andrzej&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping them alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Outlasts every challenge. Doesn&apos;t need to win fast - just win last.&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
