			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as &quot;good enough&quot; in Louis&apos;s world. They push harder, works longer, and refuse to stop until they&apos;re exactly where they want to be - because to them, success is the only acceptable outcome. Trusting Louis is a mistake most people only make once. They weave a careful web of half-truths and false assurances, making it nearly impossible to tell where their real motives lie - until they&apos;ve already gotten what they wanted. </personalityDescription>
