			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>With Leonor, what you see is what you get. She doesn&apos;t play games, doesn&apos;t manipulate, and doesn&apos;t bother with deception. Whether in battle or in conversation, she&apos;s always straightforward, even when the truth is hard to hear. Leonor fights without hesitation, pushes through gunfire and explosions, but the moment she sees blood - her or anyone else&apos;s - her focus fractures. Her breathing changes, her grip tightens, and she forces herself to look anywhere else. &quot;I&apos;m fine. I just - don&apos;t ask me to look at it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No mask. Just the person, steady and clear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
