			<personalityDescription>Jasmyn has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. While she doesn&apos;t seek attention, Jasmyn notices everything. She listens more than she speaks, analyzes before she acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. Her quiet nature makes her words all the more impactful when she chooses to share them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees the field like a map - knows where it&apos;s going before it moves.&lt;br&gt;- Quiet type. Won&apos;t lead the toast, but will notice who&apos;s missing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
