			<personalityDescription>Majdy&apos;s expertise isn&apos;t just learned - it&apos;s ingrained. Whether adapting to new challenges or refining old skills, he performs with a level of competence that leaves others struggling to keep up. Most people aren&apos;t worth Majdy&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath his notice, he brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Outpaces the rest without breaking a sweat.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
