			<personalityDescription>Ming-yu operates with a relentless sense of purpose, never allowing distractions or setbacks to pull him off course. Every failure is just another lesson, every victory another step toward his ultimate goal. Ming-yu turns everything into a competition. Who gets the most confirmed kills? Who takes out the enemy &apos;Mek fastest? Who can pee the furthest? If there&apos;s a scoreboard, real or imaginary, Ming-yu&apos;s keeping track. His lance puts up with it - mostly because, despite all the trash talk, he always buys the first round of drinks. </personalityDescription>
