			<personalityDescription>Mahmooda&apos;s mind is a finely tuned weapon, cutting through distractions and deceptions with precision. She knows exactly when to push, when to hold back, and when to strike for maximum effect. Mahmooda has watched people fail catastrophically in &apos;Meks that didn&apos;t fit them, seen them hesitate for half a second too long because they weren&apos;t in sync. She refuses to make that mistake. &quot;Piloting the wrong &apos;Mek will kill you faster than the enemy ever could.&quot; </personalityDescription>
