			<personalityDescription>Nicole knows how to get the most out of people and situations. Whether it&apos;s leveraging favors, bending the rules, or pushing people just hard enough to get results, she always makes sure she&apos;s coming out ahead. Nicole speaks with eloquence and grace because someone has to. The universe is brutal, war is endless, and civility is dying. If she starts talking like the rest of them - cold, clipped, brutal - then what&apos;s left? Just another gun for hire, another cog in the war machine. She refuses. Even if it makes her sound ridiculous, she refuses. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows how to squeeze blood from stone - always walks away with more than they gave.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
