			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ryan believes that hesitation is just another way to lose. He trusts his instincts, makes the call, and commits fully - because in his mind, the worst decision is no decision at all. Ryan will go an entire day without eating, only to inhale three full MREs right before a drop. Sometimes, he forgets to eat at all, other times, he&apos;s gnawing on a ration bar mid-skirmish. His lance has stopped questioning it - except for the tim he casually sipped a protein shake while under heavy fire. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts instincts over perfection. Believes any action is better than none.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
