			<personalityDescription>Guo-liang adapts faster than anyone else. He thrives in unpredictability, adjusting his approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes his way - no matter who gets left behind. Guo-liang doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - he does what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. </personalityDescription>
