			<personalityDescription>Chiah-jen knows hesitation gets people killed. He acts fast, takes risks, and makes hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In his mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. Everything grates on him - people, orders, even the sound of his own comms. Chiah-jen is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who he is, his temper is a fuse ready to blow. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves fast. Makes the call before anyone else dares.&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
