			<personalityDescription>Sarah acts first and deals with the consequences later. She thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Sarah never sits back and lets events unfold - she&apos;s always moving, always planning, always ensuring she&apos;s the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. </personalityDescription>
