			<personalityDescription>Teamwork is just a means to an end for Randy. He&apos;ll play along as long as it benefits him, but the moment there&apos;s something to gain, he won&apos;t hesitate to take more than his fair share. Randy commits fully to every action because he&apos;s seen what happens to people who hesitate. The ones who second-guess, who try to find a safer option, who pause at the wrong moment - they don&apos;t survive. So he doesn&apos;t stop. He doesn&apos;t hesitate. He just keeps going. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Teamwork ends where opportunity begins.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
