			<personalityDescription>Flynn gives because he knows what it&apos;s like to have nothing. He&apos;ll take the hard jobs, give up his share, and put himself in danger for the sake of others - even when it costs him more than he can afford to lose. Flynn doesn&apos;t need recognition - he just wants his people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, he offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Gives more than they should. Probably won&apos;t stop until it breaks them.&lt;br&gt;- Not in it for glory. Just wants the team to make it home.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
