			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Tuo-zhou isn&apos;t just careful - he&apos;s possessive. He stashes supplies, claims the best loot before anyone else, and resists sharing even when he has more than enough. If someone wants something from him, they&apos;d better be ready to trade big. Tuo-zhou&apos;s voice alone can turn the tide of a conversation. He speaks with conviction, adjusts his tone to fit his audience, and always seems to say exactly what people need to hear - whether it&apos;s the truth or not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- First to the salvage, last to offer help. Everything&apos;s a personal stockpile.&lt;br&gt;- Voice hits like orders, not suggestions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
