			<personalityDescription>Greg plays the long game, outmaneuvering competitors before they even realize there&apos;s a game being played. He makes alliances when they serve his goals, breaks them when they don&apos;t, and never loses sight of the bigger picture - his rise to the top. Greg knows war is ugly, merciless, brutal. But when he finds an enemy who fights with skill, honor, and intelligence, he acknowledges them. Because if there&apos;s nothing but slaughter and chaos, then what&apos;s the point of fighting at all? </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic, cold, and calculating. Plays the game better than anyone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
