			<personalityDescription>Edwina is always watching, always analyzing, never letting their guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, they stay one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Edwina sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, they don&apos;t soften the blow - because in their mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
