			<personalityDescription>Belvia moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Belvia doesn&apos;t trust anyone to provide for her, so she keeps everything for herself. Every credit, every round of ammo, every salvageable scrap is hidden away because she knows that when things go bad, only those who&apos;ve prepared will survive. </personalityDescription>
