			<personalityDescription>Rafee isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - he simply doesn&apos;t think about them. He jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for him, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. &quot;The convoy&apos;s fine? The system&apos;s stable? Uh-huh, sure.&quot; Rafee checks everything twice, then once more just in case. If someone insists a problem is solved, he immediately assumes it isn&apos;t. His coworkers roll their eyes - until he catches an issue they swore wasn&apos;t there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No thoughts of consequence. Laughs at disaster, races toward it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
