			<personalityDescription>Kasienka doesn&apos;t entertain the idea of failure. Whether it&apos;s natural talent, unbreakable will, or sheer force of personality, she carries herself like someone who expects to win - and usually does. Kasienka knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. </personalityDescription>
