			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Hirotada&apos;s eyes. He meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in his way is just another problem to crush. Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Hirotada. He&apos;s seen what chasing those things does to people, and he&apos;s perfectly happy staying right where he is, watching others run themselves into the ground. </personalityDescription>
