			<personalityDescription>Gustav meets everyone with suspicion and barely concealed aggression, always expecting betrayal. He sees the universe as a battlefield, where trust is a liability and violence is the only language that truly matters. Gustav doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. He sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if he has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
