			<personalityDescription>Machi wears their sins with a smile, making corruption look like an art form. They&apos;re slick, persuasive, and always three steps ahead, orchestrating chaos from behind the scenes while keeping their hands looking perfectly clean. Machi&apos;s actions rarely follow a clear pattern. One moment, they&apos;re cautious and methodical; the next, they&apos;re diving headfirst into chaos. Their unpredictability keeps enemies - and sometimes allies - on edge. </personalityDescription>
