			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Konrad refuses to be infected. They know they&apos;re the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment they do, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. Konrad doesn&apos;t just wake up early - they need to. They&apos;ve seen too many people go to sleep and never wake up again. They refuse to waste a single morning, because every sunrise might be the last one they see. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
