			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Maimun doesn&apos;t care about honor or fair fights - only winning. They exploit weaknesses, sacrifice pawns when necessary, and always fight on their terms. If the enemy expects a straight fight, they&apos;ve already lost. There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Maimun&apos;s world. They deliver the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, they make sure they know it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No honor, no hesitation - just results.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
