			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Kaufana is already halfway through it. She thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Kaufana doesn&apos;t rely on supply chains. She&apos;s patched together weapons from three different manufacturers, repurposed enemy tech, and turned scrap into survival tools. &quot;You trust requisitions. I trust whatever I can pull off a wrecked war machine.&quot; </personalityDescription>
