			<personalityDescription>Tome bends the rules whenever it benefits him. Whether it&apos;s skimming off the top, taking bribes, or making shady deals, he always ensures he comes out ahead - ethics be damned. Nothing really excites Tome, and nothing really bothers him either. He does his job, follows orders, and goes through the motions, but there&apos;s no passion behind it - just routine. </personalityDescription>
