			<personalityDescription>No obstacle is too great, no challenge too daunting - Arnie finds a way. When others falter, he digs deep and keeps going, turning setbacks into fuel for an unstoppable drive toward victory. Arnie doesn&apos;t wait for chances - he takes them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, he&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, he&apos;ll make one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into fuel. Driven beyond normal limits.&lt;br&gt;- Takes chances without hesitation. Morals are optional - results aren&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
