			<personalityDescription>Dulce has never met a fight she didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, she runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Dulce. She grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if she stops moving, she might have to face what she&apos;s lost along the way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
