			<personalityDescription>Xylia knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. Xylia doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs her skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does her interest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 67%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes harder than most. Sees struggle as proof they&apos;re on the right path.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t move unless the C-Bills do. Motivation ends where the payment does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
