			<personalityDescription>Micah doesn&apos;t just enjoy passion - he commands it. With a confident smirk and an irresistible charm, he draws others into his orbit, knowing exactly how to fuel the fire of desire and leave them wanting more. Micah counts enemy movements, tracks their steps, and notes the exact delay between artillery salvos. &quot;That Long Tom fires every 6.4 seconds,&quot; he mutters. &quot;We have 3.2 seconds to move.&quot; Someone scoffs - until Micah steps out exactly on time, avoiding the blast. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Draws people in, burns hot, moves on. Makes allies - or mistakes - fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
