			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>For Ruby, goals aren&apos;t just aspirations - they&apos;re obsessions. They pursue them with single-minded intensity, willing to burn bridges, break rules, and push themself beyond exhaustion if that&apos;s what it takes to achieve victory. Ruby&apos;s body reacts faster than their mind sometimes - except when it doesn&apos;t. There are moments when the pressure hits, the noise fades, and they just... stops. They hate how long it takes to snap out of it. &quot;I know. I froze. Won&apos;t happen again.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Goals aren&apos;t dreams - they&apos;re obsessions. Burns bridges to reach them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
