			<personalityDescription>Phung is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, she brings an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. People trust Phung because she&apos;s real. She doesn&apos;t fake emotions, doesn&apos;t manipulate, and doesn&apos;t care about putting on an act. Her honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes her both respected and reliable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fast mover - keeps the rest scrambling to catch up.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fake it. Wont break it. Trustworthy to a fault.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
