			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Hyotaru has no interest in. He keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in his world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Hyotaru isn&apos;t satisfied with just getting by - he wants more. Whether it&apos;s climbing the ranks, commanding his own unit, or carving his name into history, he&apos;s always pushing forward, never content to stay in one place for long. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 73%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps people away - violently if needed. Trust replaced with defense.&lt;br&gt;- Never satisfied. Always reaching for more - rank, power, legacy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
