			<personalityDescription>Alice plays the long game, outmaneuvering competitors before they even realize there&apos;s a game being played. She makes alliances when they serve her goals, breaks them when they don&apos;t, and never loses sight of the bigger picture - her rise to the top. Alice knows what happens to those who get too comfortable. She&apos;s seen it, lived through it. One second, everything&apos;s fine. The next, it&apos;s over. She stays on edge because she refuses to be caught off guard like that again. </personalityDescription>
