			<personalityDescription>Geoffrey doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make him walk away from something he&apos;s committed to. Geoffrey doesn&apos;t pretend to be something he&apos;s not. He speaks his mind, stays true to his beliefs, and refuses to put on a mask just to impress others. What you see is exactly what you get. </personalityDescription>
