			<personalityDescription>People want to believe Thomasa. Their words are smooth, their arguments airtight, and their timing impeccable. They plant ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. &quot;Thomasa, why are you singing right now?&quot; &quot;Because it helps me focus.&quot; It doesn&apos;t matter if they&apos;re pinned down or charging into an ambush - Thomasa always has a song under their breath, a slow and steady rhythm that somehow makes the chaos around them seem a little more manageable. </personalityDescription>
