			<personalityDescription>Moosa has no patience for nonsense. He cuts through distractions and emotions, keeping his mind locked onto the mission. While others get lost in doubt or debate, he moves forward with ruthless efficiency. Moosa talks to people like they&apos;re always a step behind him - because in his mind, they usually are. He assumes he knows best, rarely listens to advice, and has little patience for those who can&apos;t keep up. </personalityDescription>
