			<personalityDescription>Leocádia carries an insatiable hunger for destruction, her mind always drawn to the raw power of things being pushed past their limits. There is no satisfaction in stability - only in the knowledge that something, somewhere, is being torn apart. Leocádia doesn&apos;t just stand beside her allies - she lifts them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, she ensures that no one fights alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Only satisfied when things are breaking. Craves instability.&lt;br&gt;- Covers your six without being asked. Carries more than their weight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
