			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a goal for Eudora - it&apos;s a skill. She spots opportunities others miss, investing in the right places at the right time, always ensuring that whatever she puts in, she gets twice as much back. Eudora will go an entire day without eating, only to inhale three full MREs right before a drop. Sometimes, she forgets to eat at all, other times, she&apos;s gnawing on a ration bar mid-skirmish. Her lance has stopped questioning it - except for the tim she casually sipped a protein shake while under heavy fire. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 80%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees cash flow like others see cover - vital and always in sight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
