			<personalityDescription>Tatiana doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if she&apos;s daring the world to give her a reason to lash out. Tatiana lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, she never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always confrontational. Anticipates violence, welcomes it.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t hit the brakes - doesn&apos;t know they exist.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
