			<personalityDescription>Slowing down just isn&apos;t in Hrachia&apos;s nature. She thrives in constant motion, always chasing the next opportunity, the next fight, the next thrill - because standing still is the only thing that truly unsettles her. Hrachia has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. She lies, cheats, and takes whatever she pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In her mind, the only crime is getting caught. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stillness is discomfort. Chases motion like its purpose.&lt;br&gt;- Laughs at guilt like it&apos;s a bad joke.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
