			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Konstancji&apos;s strengths. He speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then he considers himself a saint. Konstancji has a knack for thinking on his feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, he&apos;s always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;br&gt;- Sharp tongue, sharper brain. Dangerous in any conversation.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
