			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Rizalino&apos;s strong suit. He follows instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate his path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, he never hesitates. Rizalino doesn&apos;t just win - he makes sure everyone remembers how he won. He times his final moves perfectly, adding a sense of style to every encounter. &quot;Anyone can win. Not everyone can make it look good.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy ignored. Runs on instinct and adrenaline. Sometimes lucky, always fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
