			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Xue-di&apos;s eyes. She meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in her way is just another problem to crush. Xue-di doesn&apos;t just accept corruption - she thrives in it. She manipulates the system, exploits those beneath her, and trades favors like currency. In her world, loyalty is bought, power is for sale, and morality is a weakness. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Patience dismissed as weakness. Crushes obstacles with brute force.&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty&apos;s just a receipt - they only back who pays best.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
