			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Thom sees uncertainty as an invitation rather than a threat. He steps into the unknown without hesitation, confident that no matter what awaits, he&apos;ll find a way through. Thom doesn&apos;t freeze in the dark - he moves, acts, does anything but stand there and let the blackness settle around him. The quiet, the emptiness, the feeling of not knowing what&apos;s lurking? Unacceptable. &quot;I&apos;ll take an open skirmish over this any day. At least bullets don&apos;t sneak up on you from nowhere.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats uncertainty like a map. Goes first, figures it out mid-stride.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
