			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Every bolt tightened, every route mapped, every contingency accounted for - Mary leaves nothing to chance. She operates with surgical precision, believing that even the smallest miscalculation could mean the difference between victory and disaster. Mary never lets the chaos of battle stop her from throwing in a well-timed flirt. Explosions in the background? Enemy fire raining down? She&apos;s still casually complimenting someone&apos;s voice over the comms. &quot;You know, if we survive this, you owe me dinner for saving your ass just now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Contingency for everything. Operates like a mek with no wasted motion.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
