			<personalityDescription>José doesn&apos;t just keep up - he stays ahead. He spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. José has a story for every situation. &quot;This reminds me of that time on New Aragon - similar terrain, same terrible odds, and guess what? We made it through that one too.&quot; His lance isn&apos;t sure whether he&apos;s boosting morale or just reliving his favorite moments. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
