			<personalityDescription>Jung-Sook doesn&apos;t waste time on sentiment - she does what it takes to win. Morality, loyalty, and fairness are just obstacles, and she has no patience for those too weak to do what&apos;s necessary. Jung-Sook is a natural at what she does. Whether it&apos;s piloting, strategy, or problem-solving, she picks things up quickly and executes with precision, making even the most difficult tasks look effortless. </personalityDescription>
