			<personalityDescription>Derek always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much he has, it&apos;s never enough, and he&apos;s always looking for the next way to add to his wealth and status. Derek doesn&apos;t just track time - he hoards it. Every lost minute is another missed opportunity, another delay that could mean something worse later. He moves fast, plans faster, because slowing down means acknowledging what time is really counting down to. </personalityDescription>
