			<personalityDescription>Sylvia makes it seem like she&apos;s a team player, but everything she does is carefully crafted to benefit herself first. She&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for her, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the one standing on top. No amount of scrubbing can wash the blood from her hands. Sylvia showers until her skin is raw, sterilizes her gear twice before every battle, and wipes down every surface she touches. She tells herself it&apos;s just habit, but deep down, she knows - no matter how hard she tries, some stains never come out. </personalityDescription>
