			<personalityDescription>Randy doesn&apos;t acknowledge fear as anything more than a passing thought. They move forward with unwavering certainty, meeting every challenge as if failure were never a possibility. Randy doesn&apos;t panic - they make a dry remark and keeps moving. &quot;We&apos;re outnumbered ten to one.&quot; Randy nods. &quot;Oh good, that&apos;s an even fight.&quot; Their lance isn&apos;t sure if they&apos;re fearless or just too dead inside to care anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t consider failure. Confidence absolute - maybe dangerously so.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
