			<personalityDescription>No matter what gets thrown at her, Bhuvana bounces back. Whether it&apos;s a brutal loss, a catastrophic failure, or a battlefield injury, she refuses to let anything break her. Bhuvana will take the long way if it means avoiding enclosed areas. She doesn&apos;t do tunnels, small vehicles (not anymore), or tight formations. If there&apos;s only one exit, she&apos;s already looking for another option. &quot;One way in, one way out? Yeah, not happening. That&apos;s how people die like rats in a hole.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 19%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes the hit, gets back up. Nothing breaks them for long.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
