			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Ioan, the kind that makes people listen when he speaks and follow when he leads. He doesn&apos;t need to prove himself - he already knows where he stands. Ioan has an uncanny sense for when things are getting too tense. Right before things boil over, he fires off a well-timed finger gun and a grin just wide enough to throw people off. It shouldn&apos;t work - but it does. </personalityDescription>
