			<personalityDescription>Agatha doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - she creates it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, she throws herself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward her next goal. Every harsh wind feels like the bite of an old wound. Every humid jungle reminds her of the infections she barely survived. Every freezing night brings back the ghost of near-hypothermia. Agatha&apos;s body has been through hell, and now it feels every shift in the weather like a lingering punishment. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes their own opportunities. Relentless pursuit of the next goal.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
