			<personalityDescription>In a universe full of deception, Rashida is refreshingly straightforward. She says what she means, does what she promises, and refuses to play games just to gain favor. Her word is one of the few things that can be trusted. Rashida doesn&apos;t just push up her glasses - she does it while scanning enemy formations, calculating range corrections, or muttering about heat efficiency. Her lance has learned that when she adjusts them twice in a row, she&apos;s about to say something really important. If she takes them off, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 72%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Straight shooter. Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t budge, won&apos;t lie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
