			<personalityDescription>Once Ameena makes up her mind, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. Plans don&apos;t change, orders don&apos;t get questioned, and she sure as hell isn&apos;t going to admit being  wrong - not now, not ever. Ameena doesn&apos;t just react - she knows. Her instincts are so sharp it&apos;s almost unsettling, predicting ambushes, betrayals, and hidden dangers before they reveal themselves. Some say it&apos;s luck. Ameena knows better. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decisions are final. Won&apos;t revisit, revise, or admit error.&lt;br&gt;- Makes the hair stand up. Knows what&apos;s coming before it hits.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
