			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>With Shejali, what you see is what you get. They don&apos;t play games, don&apos;t manipulate, and don&apos;t bother with deception. Whether in battle or in conversation, they&apos;re always straightforward, even when the truth is hard to hear. Shejali keeps flipping comm channels because silence means something has gone wrong. Someone&apos;s down. A signal&apos;s lost. A lance isn&apos;t reporting back. They&apos;ve seen too many signals go quiet forever - so they never stop listening, because the moment they do, they might miss someone&apos;s last words. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No mask. Just the person, steady and clear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
