			<personalityDescription>Tatjana sees morality as a luxury they can&apos;t afford. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient way to get ahead - no matter how brutal - they&apos;ll take it without hesitation or regret. Tatjana&apos;s attention to detail is unmatched. Whether reviewing battlefield intel or adjusting a targeting system, they work tirelessly to ensure every factor is in their favor - because in their world, overlooking one detail is a mistake they refuse to make. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brutality is a shortcut - and they never hesitate to take it.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t blink without a checklist. Won&apos;t move until every variable&apos;s locked down.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
