			<personalityDescription>Once Carolyn sets her sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping her. She thrives on momentum, constantly pushing herself and those around her to reach new heights. Carolyn has every mission, training session, and equipment check meticulously scheduled. She even sets reminders for &quot;Check Ammo Reserves&quot; and &quot;Pre-Battle Meditation.&quot; Her lance laughs at her - until they realize she&apos;s never the one caught off-guard when an op gets moved up at the last minute. </personalityDescription>
