			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Phuong-Hien&apos;s world. She steps forward without looking back, her decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether she&apos;s right or wrong, she never lingers in uncertainty. Phuong-Hien can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. She spins stories, plays up her credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, she&apos;s long gone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Could sell ice to polar troops and vanish before the melt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
