			<personalityDescription>Yu-Chiang doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Yu-Chiang always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much she has, it&apos;s never enough, and she&apos;s always looking for the next way to add to her wealth and status. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees setbacks as challenges, not endings. Keeps advancing.&lt;br&gt;- Wants it all - wealth, power, status - and wont stop clawing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
