			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Bertrand refuses to be infected. He knows he&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment he does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. Bertrand operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 72%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
