			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in Henna&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. There could be an emergency, a full company deployment, a reactor on fire - but Henna will not start work without drinking from her one mug. &quot;Things function better with consistency,&quot; she says, taking another sip. The fact that she talks about her mug the same way she talks about people is concerning. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
