			<personalityDescription>Aylin&apos;s enjoyment of conflict goes far beyond strategy or skill. There&apos;s a gleam in her eye whenever someone else is hurting, a twisted satisfaction in knowing that the suffering is entirely her doing. Aylin never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, she&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - she calls it smart business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Finds pleasure in cruelty. Hurt is the goal, not the side effect.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds every deal dry. Doesn&apos;t care who&apos;s on the other end.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
