			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Jonrid&apos;s mind. Once they set their course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make them stray from it. Jonrid insists on addressing even their closest comrades as &quot;Lieutenant,&quot; &quot;Sergeant,&quot; or &quot;esteemed colleague.&quot; No one knows if it&apos;s a quirk, a joke, or if they actually think they&apos;re all attending a formal gala instead of wading through battlefield wreckage. Either way, it makes war sound bizarrely polite. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No room for doubt. Once locked in, nothing sways them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
