			<personalityDescription>Why wait when you can act? Jendayi leaps before looking, speaks before thinking, and never backs down from a challenge. Whether it&apos;s a high-stakes battle or a bad bet, they are always rolling the dice, just to see what happens. Jendayi&apos;s energy is contagious. They have a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps into trouble for the thrill. Makes chaos just to see the outcome.&lt;br&gt;- Good for keeping heads up when things go south.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
