			<personalityDescription>Rosemary&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, she keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. Rosemary knows the fight is her, but she waits - lining up the perfect shot, setting up a final strike that leaves no doubt. If it doesn&apos;t feel cinematic, it wasn&apos;t done right. &quot;It&apos;s not just about beating them. It&apos;s about ending it in a way they&apos;ll never forget.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
