			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Joyce&apos;s eyes. She meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in her way is just another problem to crush. Joyce doesn&apos;t go down easy. Even when the odds are stacked against her, she grits her teeth, digs in, and keeps pushing forward. She&apos;s the kind of fighter who walks out of a wrecked &apos;Mek, bleeding but grinning, ready for round two. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Patience dismissed as weakness. Crushes obstacles with brute force.&lt;br&gt;- Grits teeth, keeps moving. Bleeding, grinning, ready for more.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
