			<personalityDescription>Brianna doesn&apos;t waste time on distractions. She measures success not by effort but by results, constantly driving forward with a clear vision of where she&apos;s going and how she&apos;ll get there. Brianna is ruled by her desires, chasing pleasure with reckless abandon. She consumes, indulges, and takes what she wants without concern for the consequences, leaving behind a trail of broken promises and burned bridges. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Measures success by outcome, not effort. Keeps the path clear and forward.&lt;br&gt;- Chases pleasure like it&apos;s a mission objective. Leaves wreckage behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
