			<personalityDescription>Yong-koo doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights - he believes in surviving. He&apos;ll lie, cheat, betray, and destroy without hesitation, because in his world, there&apos;s no room for second place. If someone isn&apos;t strong enough to keep up, they don&apos;t deserve to be here. Yong-koo isn&apos;t excessively marking maps out of habit - he&apos;s doing it because he&apos;s been in situations where people got lost, where wrong turns led to death, where missing a NavPoint meant disaster. If the map is overloaded, so be it. At least no one can say they didn&apos;t know where to go. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fair fights are for fools. Ruthless, deceptive, and deadly efficient.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
