			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in John&apos;s world - he already knows he&apos;s right. He speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of his valuable time. John has seen too many people get left behind. He won&apos;t let it happen again. If his lance is in trouble, he&apos;s already moving to cover them. Because if someone has to take the risk, it&apos;ll be him - every time. </personalityDescription>
