			<personalityDescription>Christie doesn&apos;t just lead - she elevates those around her. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, she makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. Christie doesn&apos;t trust victories. She&apos;s seen how overconfidence gets people killed, how one unchecked mistake can doom an entire lance. So she criticizes everything, no matter how small. Because if people stop improving, they stop surviving. </personalityDescription>
