			<personalityDescription>Vera has big dreams and no intention of staying in the background. Whether it&apos;s becoming a legendary warrior, a feared commander, or a name spoken with respect across the Inner Sphere, she&apos;s always pushing herself toward something greater. Everything grates on her - people, orders, even the sound of her own comms. Vera is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who she is, her temper is a fuse ready to blow. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has big goals and no plans to stay in the shadows. Ambition drives every move.&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
