			<personalityDescription>Tarik doesn&apos;t slow down, doesn&apos;t stop, doesn&apos;t rest. Whether in battle, in business, or in pursuit of power, he demands more - more resources, more control, more everything - because anything less feels like losing. Even in the heat of war, Tarik never loses sight of the people fighting beside him. Whether it&apos;s sharing supplies, covering for a comrade&apos;s mistake, or simply checking in, he proves that true leadership starts with empathy. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Operates like the universe owes them more. Never stops collecting.&lt;br&gt;- Leads with empathy. The kind we need more of.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
