			<personalityDescription>Kali treats every challenge like a battle of endurance, convinced that if she just holds out long enough, the world will bend before she does. Sometimes it works - sometimes it just makes life harder for everyone around her. Kali knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats resistance as victory. Outlasts opposition - at a cost.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes harder than most. Sees struggle as proof they&apos;re on the right path.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
