			<personalityDescription>Distractions are for other people - Noora doesn&apos;t indulge them. She keeps her attention locked onto the task at hand, tuning out anything that doesn&apos;t push her closer to success. Noora moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze her - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. She does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Tunes out distractions completely. Sees only the path forward.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt flinch, doesnt linger - just keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
