			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Forbia has no patience for hesitation. They face overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop them. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. Forbia believes in their unit and makes sure they know it. Whether it&apos;s a few words of confidence before a mission or lifting someone up after a failure, they always push others to be their best. </personalityDescription>
