			<personalityDescription>Pierluigi enjoys working the angles, setting up small tricks and clever deceptions just to see how people react. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield feint or a harmless prank, he finds joy in out-thinking and outmaneuvering those around him. Broken equipment, impossible deadlines, an infuriating lack of cooperation - Pierluigi just smiles through it all. &quot;Pierluigi, you&apos;re really calm about this.&quot; &quot;Oh, absolutely,&quot; he says through clenched teeth, his grin unwavering as he contemplates murder. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trickster streak - uses games to test the board.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
