			<personalityDescription>Kristina struts through every situation with an air of undeniable superiority, convinced that her mere presence guarantees victory. Her self-assurance borders on arrogance, leaving little room for any doubts - even when caution would be wise. Kristina knows how to work a room, flip a deal, and turn a conversation in her favor. Whether she&apos;s negotiating a contract or outwitting an opponent, she never wastes a word - or an opportunity. </personalityDescription>
