			<personalityDescription>Sonja does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. She isn&apos;t lazy - she just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. Patience has never been Sonja&apos;s strong suit. She leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, her restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - she lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not lazy, just finished trying. No threat, no spark.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
