			<personalityDescription>Won-shik moves through life with absolute certainty, his presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When he speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Won-shik wears his confidence like a badge of honor, parading his victories with flair and dismissing setbacks as temporary blips. His unwavering belief in his own prowess often blinds him to potential dangers, even as he dazzles onlookers with his bold, if misguided, bravado. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- Flaunts wins, shrugs off losses. Blind spots hidden behind bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
