			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Alicia&apos;s world. She delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, she makes sure they know it. Alicia insists that &apos;Meks have quirks, and some people sync with them better than others. She notices who flows naturally with their unit and who is constantly fighting it. &quot;You don&apos;t just control it - you work with it. And if that doesn&apos;t happen, you&apos;re in the wrong &apos;Mek.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
