			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as half-measures with Zoe. Everything she does is full-throttle, fueled by relentless determination and an unwillingness to accept anything less than total victory. Zoe isn&apos;t just tough - she&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage her, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow her down. She keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. </personalityDescription>
