			<personalityDescription>Nam is convinced she can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. She stretches herself thin, takes on risks she shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether she can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of her vocabulary. Yet. In a ruthless world, Nam refuses to become another heartless warrior. She watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs her. The weight of every choice lingers in her mind, but she&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
