			<personalityDescription>Marlies understands that no one has all the answers - not even them. They remain open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. By the time others are starting their first briefing, Marlies has already run a full systems check, a workout, and possibly a simulated battle. &quot;I&apos;ve been productive for hours,&quot; they grim, as someone else mumbles, &quot;It&apos;s literally 05:00.&quot; </personalityDescription>
