			<personalityDescription>Tara doesn&apos;t just take - she devours. Every resource, every opportunity, every advantage is her for the taking, and she won&apos;t stop until she&apos;s stripped the battlefield, the deal, or the moment for everything it&apos;s worth. Tara knows exactly what to say to get people on her side, but her words rarely match her true intentions. She smiles, flatters, and makes promises, but beneath it all, she&apos;s only looking out for herself. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hits with the force of obsession. Stand clear or get flattened.&lt;br&gt;- All charm, no substance. Says the right things, means none of them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
