			<personalityDescription>Diane knows best - just ask her. Whether it&apos;s battle tactics, logistics, or how to hold a damn coffee cup, she has an opinion and makes sure everyone hears it. If Diane had more hands, she would probably try to do everyone&apos;s job at the same time. Diane doesn&apos;t withdraw because she&apos;s afraid - she withdraws because she&apos;s tired. She&apos;s seen too many fights, too much bloodshed, and she knows how easily lives are thrown away for nothing. If she walks away, it&apos;s because she values her survival more than someone else&apos;s idea of honor. </personalityDescription>
