			<personalityDescription>Vannessa knows best - just ask her. Whether it&apos;s battle tactics, logistics, or how to hold a damn coffee cup, she has an opinion and makes sure everyone hears it. If Vannessa had more hands, she would probably try to do everyone&apos;s job at the same time. Vannessa doesn&apos;t just want to prove herself - she needs to. She throws herself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show she&apos;s worthy of something bigger. </personalityDescription>
