			<personalityDescription>Kankana doesn&apos;t waste time on pretenses. She lives by her own code, unshaken by outside pressure, and refuses to compromise who she is just to fit someone else&apos;s version of how she should be. Kankana&apos;s habit of making clothes started after too many cold nights, too many friends without enough gear. If she can&apos;t keep them alive in a fight, the least she can do is keep them warm after. &quot;You wear it, you remember why you survived. And you don&apos;t waste it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
