			<personalityDescription>Manu doesn&apos;t believe in rules - only results. She&apos;ll step on allies, deceive enemies, and manipulate anyone in her way, all with a cold efficiency that leaves no room for doubt or regret. Manu doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs her skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does her interest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks rules, breaks people. Leaves no one behind - unless it benefits them.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t move unless the C-Bills do. Motivation ends where the payment does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
