			<personalityDescription>Barbara believes that strength isn&apos;t just about winning battles - it&apos;s about lifting others up. They offer encouragement when morale is low, step in when someone struggles, and always ensure those around them feel seen and valued. Barbara doesn&apos;t see narrow escapes as luck - they see them as confirmation. Every bullet that whizzes past, every enemy that fails to land a hit just fuels their belief that they&apos;re invincible. &quot;You see that? Didn&apos;t even graze me. Like I said, they can&apos;t hit me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t forget the people in the fight. Makes sure no one gets left behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
