			<personalityDescription>Scott&apos;s patience is as short as his temper is explosive. He doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - he reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around him scrambling to keep up. Scott has a habit of letting things slide - deadlines, promises, even basic maintenance. He always means to get around to it, but somehow, there&apos;s always something more interesting or pressing to focus on instead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Zero patience. Reacts fast, hits hard. Team scrambles to keep pace.&lt;br&gt;- Always &quot;meant to&quot; do it. Never does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
