			<personalityDescription>Myung-jin notices the details others miss - the flicker of movement in the distance, the shift in tone during negotiations. She stays sharp, ready to act at a moment&apos;s notice, because the one time she isn&apos;t prepared might be the last. Myung-jin doesn&apos;t just fire her weapon - she tracks every single shot. &quot;Nine left. Two more reloads. Twenty-three hostiles still moving.&quot; Her lance doesn&apos;t always appreciate the running tally, but when ammo runs low, Myung-jin&apos;s the only one who actually knows how much is left. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Catches what others miss. Operates on constant edge-readiness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
