			<personalityDescription>The more dangerous the path, the more certain Shafi is that it&apos;s the right one. They move forward without fear, seeing every unknown as a puzzle to solve, a victory to claim, or a story to tell later. Shafi doesn&apos;t just like to lead - they needs to. Every decision, every plan, every battle has to go their way, and they expect absolute obedience. Anything less is just another problem to be dealt with. </personalityDescription>
