			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Toni&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making her presence known, she moves through life like she&apos;s already won. Toni never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, she&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - she calls it smart business. </personalityDescription>
