			<personalityDescription>Fedya doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - they create it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, they throw themself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward their next goal. Small talk? Useless. Second-guessing orders? Infuriating. Fedya&apos;s tolerance for anything that slows them down is nonexistent. They&apos;re not always outright angry, but the scowl, the sharp tone, and the way they glare say more than words ever could. </personalityDescription>
