			<personalityDescription>Shaun doesn&apos;t get attached. They see suffering, loss, and hardship, but none of it seems to affect them. Whether it&apos;s a defense mechanism or just who they are, they keep their emotions locked away and move forward without hesitation. Shaun doesn&apos;t rely on others to clean up after a crisis - they expect to be the last one handling it. &quot;If this whole system fails, I&apos;m the one who&apos;s going to be picking up the pieces. So excuse me if I make damn sure it doesn&apos;t.&quot; </personalityDescription>
