			<personalityDescription>Ogan&apos;s loyalty is as fleeting as a paycheck. He makes allies when it&apos;s convenient, breaks deals when it suits him, and always keeps an escape route ready in case things turn south. Ogan&apos;s comrades keep dying. His gear? It stays. So he talks to it, maintains it with care, treats it like it&apos;s alive - because at least it won&apos;t bleed out on him. At least it won&apos;t leave. </personalityDescription>
