			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Lewis just calls it doing what needs to be done. He doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; he simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Lewis has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. He gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding his annoyance. </personalityDescription>
