			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Glen is the rock they lean on. He doesn&apos;t just stand his ground - he inspires others to do the same, proving that true strength comes from never backing down, no matter how impossible the fight may seem. Glen views war as a puzzle, and people as pieces to be moved. Emotions don&apos;t factor into his decisions - only efficiency and effectiveness. If sacrificing a few pawns guarantees his success, he won&apos;t hesitate to make the call. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Anchor under pressure. Stands firm and inspires others to follow.&lt;br&gt;- Cold-blooded tactician. Will trade lives like poker chips.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
