			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Gusta trusts no one. They watch every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, their constant vigilance has kept them alive this long. Gusta sees people spend too much time planning when the best solution is just doing the obvious thing. &quot;We could run three simulations, analyze terrain variations, and draft contingencies... or we could just shoot the thing that&apos;s causing problems.&quot; </personalityDescription>
