			<personalityDescription>To Zaria, obstacles are just opportunities that haven&apos;t realized they&apos;ve lost yet. They meet every challenge with unwavering confidence, their presence alone enough to make people second-guess their own hesitation. With Zaria, what you see is what you get. They don&apos;t play games, don&apos;t manipulate, and don&apos;t bother with deception. Whether in battle or in conversation, they&apos;re always straightforward, even when the truth is hard to hear. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns problems into stepping stones. Confidence shakes others out of doubt.&lt;br&gt;- No mask. Just the person, steady and clear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
