			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Erna&apos;s world. She delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, she makes sure they know it. Erna has a quote for everything. Before a mission? &quot;Fortune favors the bold.&quot; After losing a comrade? &quot;War does not determine who is right, only who is left.&quot; Some find it inspiring. Others wish she&apos;d just shut up and fight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
