			<personalityDescription>Marijse doesn&apos;t just give - she gives big. Whether it&apos;s picking up the tab, upgrading a friend&apos;s &apos;Mek, or spreading wealth where it&apos;s needed, she believes that success means nothing if you can&apos;t share it. Marijse never gives a straight answer. She dodges questions, avoids commitments, and keeps people guessing about where she really stands. It&apos;s not outright lying - it&apos;s just never letting anyone get close enough to see the truth. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Generosity&apos;s big, loud, and hard to miss - keeps spreading the wealth like it&apos;ll never run out.&lt;br&gt;- Never commits. Just enough truth to stay slippery.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
