			<personalityDescription>Ndrèu believes that hesitation is just another way to lose. He trusts his instincts, makes the call, and commits fully - because in his mind, the worst decision is no decision at all. Ndrèu doesn&apos;t just steal - he takes. Money, gear, secrets - nothing is off-limits. He sees ownership as a temporary state, and if someone isn&apos;t strong or smart enough to hold onto what&apos;s theirs, they don&apos;t deserve to keep it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts instincts over perfection. Believes any action is better than none.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t believe in ownership - only opportunity.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
