			<personalityDescription>Mariana doesn&apos;t just dream - she plans. Every action she takes is calculated to move her forward, and she doesn&apos;t get distracted by short-term setbacks or fleeting opportunities. If she wants something, she&apos;ll get it, one way or another. Mariana doesn&apos;t rely on supply chains. She&apos;s patched together weapons from three different manufacturers, repurposed enemy tech, and turned scrap into survival tools. &quot;You trust requisitions. I trust whatever I can pull off a wrecked war machine.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plans every step. Ignores setbacks - only progress matters.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
