			<personalityDescription>Erika&apos;s drive is more than ambition - it&apos;s an unshakable force. She doesn&apos;t just work hard; she outworks everyone, refusing to rest until she&apos;s accomplished what she set out to do. Erika knows what she&apos;s doing, but she still asks. &quot;You sure about this plan?&quot; &quot;We&apos;re really going in now?&quot; She won&apos;t commit until someone gives her a nod, a pat on the shoulder, anything to prove she&apos;s not messing up. She&apos;s not afraid of battle - she&apos;s afraid of disappointing someone. </personalityDescription>
