			<personalityDescription>Yvonne doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - she makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, she&apos;s always one step ahead. Yvonne doesn&apos;t check in, doesn&apos;t follow up, and doesn&apos;t worry about what gets left behind. If something was truly important, someone else would have reminded her - or better yet, handled it themselves. </personalityDescription>
