			<personalityDescription>Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Markell. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining his gear, or following through on commitments, he tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. Markell doesn&apos;t just fight for respect - he fights for recognition. He&apos;s seen what happens to the ones who blend into the background, the ones no one remembers when the dust settles. If being doubted means pushing himself harder, then so be it. &quot;You think I can&apos;t do it? Then I have to. Because otherwise, I&apos;m nothing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
