			<personalityDescription>Justin makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through his unshakable resolve, his fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where he reminds someone of their worth, he sparks hope in even the darkest times. Justin hates absolute silence. It makes his skin crawl, sets his nerves on edge. He&apos;ll risk whispering, muttering, or making a joke just to break the tension. &quot;Radio&apos;s dead silent? Yeah, okay, now I&apos;m worried.&quot; </personalityDescription>
