			<personalityDescription>Violence isn&apos;t just a tool for Kasienka - it&apos;s the default setting. She sees every interaction as a challenge, every stare as a provocation, and every battle as a chance to break something... or someone. Peace is just the pause before the next conflict. People want to believe Kasienka. Her words are smooth, her arguments airtight, and her timing impeccable. She plants ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Interprets peace as waiting room for violence. Every glance is a challenge.&lt;br&gt;- Ideas take root. You only notice when it&apos;s too late.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
