			<personalityDescription>Hoa thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. He refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing himself and everyone around him past their limits. Hoa doesn&apos;t just hear people - he listens. Whether it&apos;s a new strategy, a fresh perspective, or a hard truth, he takes in information without letting pride or stubbornness get in the way of growth. </personalityDescription>
