			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Tikaroa moves like they&apos;ve got an internal reactor running at full burn. Whether it&apos;s work, combat, or downtime, they tackle everything with relentless enthusiasm, always ready for the next challenge. Tikaroa always seems like they&apos;re one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, their irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves like they&apos;re burning fuel nonstop. Thrives on constant engagement.&lt;br&gt;- Complains the whole op. Still finishes first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
