			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Lazar&apos; has no interest in. He keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in his world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. To Lazar&apos;, restraint is a foreign concept. He surrounds himself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy his endless cravings - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps people away - violently if needed. Trust replaced with defense.&lt;br&gt;- Lives for indulgence - luxury, temptation, distraction. A liability in quiet moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
