			<personalityDescription>Kinara makes everything look effortless. He doesn&apos;t need detailed plans or complex tactics - he just feels the right move in the moment and acts on it, as if success is second nature to him. Kinara has a habit of letting things slide - deadlines, promises, even basic maintenance. He always means to get around to it, but somehow, there&apos;s always something more interesting or pressing to focus on instead. </personalityDescription>
