			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Miron&apos;s world. He steps forward without looking back, his decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether he&apos;s right or wrong, he never lingers in uncertainty. Miron keeps his lance energized and his enemies confused by ensuring every engagement comes with a backing track. One moment it&apos;s hard-hitting metal, the next it&apos;s a slow, eerie hum that unsettles everyone. &quot;Oh, you don&apos;t like my music? Guess you better finish the fight fast then.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
