			<personalityDescription>Lisbeth doesn&apos;t waste time with hesitation - once a decision is made, she commits fully. On the battlefield, she acts with precision and confidence, knowing that in the chaos of war, a fast decision is often better than a perfect one. Lisbeth moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze her - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. She does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commits fast, no waffling. Values momentum over precision. Trusts instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt flinch, doesnt linger - just keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
