			<personalityDescription>Ju-long doesn&apos;t waste time on distractions. He measures success not by effort but by results, constantly driving forward with a clear vision of where he&apos;s going and how he&apos;ll get there. Ju-long doesn&apos;t flinch under fire, doesn&apos;t panic when missiles rain down - but his fingers tell a different story. His nails are jagged, bitten down to near nothing, the casualty of endless waiting, briefing delays, and long hours in the scrum. It&apos;s not fear, he insists. Just something to do while the next battle looms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Measures success by outcome, not effort. Keeps the path clear and forward.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
