			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Claudian is already halfway through it. They thrive on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Claudian doesn&apos;t leave anything to chance. They analyze, adapt, and execute with precision, always thinking three steps ahead to ensure they control the game rather than being a piece in it. </personalityDescription>
