			<personalityDescription>Gracie exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment she enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in her world. Small talk? Useless. Second-guessing orders? Infuriating. Gracie&apos;s tolerance for anything that slows her down is nonexistent. She&apos;s not always outright angry, but the scowl, the sharp tone, and the way she glares say more than words ever could. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries weight just by entering a room. Commands presence without trying.&lt;br&gt;- Mood? Permanent scowl. Voice? Razor-edged.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
