			<personalityDescription>Carol walks into every fight like she owns the battlefield, radiating confidence and daring anyone to prove her wrong. Whether it&apos;s leading the charge or taunting an enemy over open comms, she thrives on being the center of attention - and usually has the skills to back it up. Carol never hides behind false pretenses or empty words. She stands by her beliefs, never bending to fit expectations, and makes no apologies for who she is - whether people like it or not. </personalityDescription>
