			<personalityDescription>Elliott is most comfortable in the quiet, away from the noise and chaos of crowded rooms. He doesn&apos;t mind company, but he prefers to keep his circle small - only those he trusts, and even that list is short. Elliott doesn&apos;t just complete things - he ensures that the ending feels significant. Whether it&apos;s a final word, a well-timed reveal, or a perfect conclusion, he knows how to leave an impression. &quot;No, no, no. You can&apos;t just finish it. You have to stick the landing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
