			<personalityDescription>Jenna doesn&apos;t just take charge - she owns every situation she steps into. Her presence alone demands compliance, and she has little patience for those who hesitate to fall in line. Jenna operates with a relentless sense of purpose, never allowing distractions or setbacks to pull her off course. Every failure is just another lesson, every victory another step toward her ultimate goal. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Dominates by presence alone. Expects immediate compliance.&lt;br&gt;- Treats setbacks as fuel. Purpose overrides all distractions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
