			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s determination, and then there&apos;s Marjani. Once she makes a decision, no amount of logic, pleading, or even superior orders will make her budge. Whether it&apos;s admirable or infuriating depends on who you ask. Marjani listens before she speaks, always considering different perspectives before making decisions. She values input from others and is quick to adapt when presented with new information. </personalityDescription>
