			<personalityDescription>Jack never truly relaxes - their mind is always scanning, always assessing. Every situation is a puzzle, every interaction a potential threat, and they refuse to be caught  off guard. Jack sees every interaction as a transaction, and they always make sure they come out ahead. If there&apos;s a choice between helping others or helping themself, there&apos;s never really a choice at all. </personalityDescription>
