			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Vivecka is probably already doing it. She doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - she buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Vivecka whistles while mounting the DropShip, while advancing through enemy fire, while standing over the wreckage of a downed opponent. It&apos;s never frantic - always slow, steady, calm. Her lance isn&apos;t sure if it&apos;s confidence or insanity, but when the whistling stops, they know things have gone very wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases danger for fun. Dares what others dismiss. Laughs off rules.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
