			<personalityDescription>In a universe full of deception, Donata is refreshingly straightforward. She says what she means, does what she promises, and refuses to play games just to gain favor. Her word is one of the few things that can be trusted. Donata doesn&apos;t believe in titles. The lead mechanic is &apos;Grease,&apos; the MedTech is &apos;Patches,&apos; and the newest recruit is &apos;Grass&apos; until they earn something better. It&apos;s all part of the company&apos;s culture now - at this point, even she probably doesn&apos;t remember their real names. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Straight shooter. Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t budge, won&apos;t lie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
