			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Paul&apos;s world. They step forward without looking back, their decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether they&apos;re right or wrong, they never linger in uncertainty. The object in Paul&apos;s possession isn&apos;t sentimental - it&apos;s survival. A reminder of who they used to be, of a promise they couldn&apos;t keep, of a person they once knew. They don&apos;t talk about it, don&apos;t let anyone touch it, don&apos;t explain why they refuse to part with it. Some wounds don&apos;t bleed, but they never heal either. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
