			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no middle ground with Tameka - everything is turned up to eleven. She doesn&apos;t just prepare; she over-prepares. She doesn&apos;t just act; she goes all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, she hasn&apos;t found it yet. Tameka sees through people like glass. She picks apart their motives, exploits their weaknesses, and predicts their actions before they even realize what they&apos;re going to do. It&apos;s not empathy - it&apos;s just another tool for survival. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cranks every dial to max. No balance, no brakes.&lt;br&gt;- Picks targets apart like it&apos;s instinct. Cold, fast, surgical.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
