			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Kiley carves a path forward with unwavering determination. She doesn&apos;t ask for permission and doesn&apos;t wait for approval - Kiley acts, and others either follow or get left behind. To Kiley, control isn&apos;t about leadership - it&apos;s about domination. She micromanages, manipulates, and enforces her will through intimidation or force. If someone steps out of line, they&apos;ll regret it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts without asking. Leads by momentum. Others fall in line or fall behind.&lt;br&gt;- Leads through domination. Controls through fear, force, or pressure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
