			<personalityDescription>Ilda is never caught off guard. They read situations in real time, adjust their strategy on the fly, and always have a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, they find a way to turn the fight in their favor. Ilda&apos;s voice alone can turn the tide of a conversation. They speak with conviction, adjust their tone to fit their audience, and always seem to say exactly what people need to hear - whether it&apos;s the truth or not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads the battlefield like a map he drew himself.&lt;br&gt;- Voice hits like orders, not suggestions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
