			<personalityDescription>Bezzi never acts without a plan. Every move he makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time his opponents realize what&apos;s happening, he&apos;s already won. Bezzi has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. He lies, cheats, and takes whatever he pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In his mind, the only crime is getting caught. </personalityDescription>
