			<personalityDescription>Gabriel sees the universe as one giant stockpile, and they&apos;re determined to take the biggest share. Every resource and every opportunity is something to be claimed, and they refuse to be left wanting. Whether they&apos;re filling out paperwork, troubleshooting, or giving a report, Gabriel&apos;s pen never stops spinning. &quot;That&apos;s going to fly out of your hand one day,&quot; someone says. &quot;Not today,&quot; they reply, flipping it behind their back and catching it without looking. </personalityDescription>
