			<personalityDescription>Becky doesn&apos;t just lead - she elevates those around her. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, she makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. Becky&apos;s hatred for Mek isn&apos;t abstract. She&apos;s been on the wrong side of a &apos;Mek&apos;s guns, seen cities crushed under metal feet, watched people disappear in a flash of energy fire. She doesn&apos;t fear &apos;Meks - she despires them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt bark orders - just makes you want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
