			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Andre isn&apos;t just careful - he&apos;s possessive. He stashes supplies, claims the best loot before anyone else, and resists sharing even when he has more than enough. If someone wants something from him, they&apos;d better be ready to trade big. Andre sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, he doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in his mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- First to the salvage, last to offer help. Everything&apos;s a personal stockpile.&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
