			<personalityDescription>Sylvie treats every challenge like a battle of endurance, convinced that if she just holds out long enough, the world will bend before she does. Sometimes it works - sometimes it just makes life harder for everyone around her. Sylvie puts in the work, no matter how long it takes. Whether it&apos;s maintaining her combat unit, planning battle strategies, or honing her skills, she refuses to cut corners - because in her mind, effort is what separates the competent from the dead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats resistance as victory. Outlasts opposition - at a cost.&lt;br&gt;- Puts in the hours. Refuses shortcuts - effort equals survival.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
