			<personalityDescription>Angela plays the long game, outmaneuvering competitors before they even realize there&apos;s a game being played. She makes alliances when they serve her goals, breaks them when they don&apos;t, and never loses sight of the bigger picture - her rise to the top. Angela isn&apos;t cruel, but she doesn&apos;t see the point in getting emotionally invested. She makes decisions based on logic, not feelings, and while others may take things personally, she simply shrugs and moves on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic, cold, and calculating. Plays the game better than anyone.&lt;br&gt;- Shrugs off blood, blame, and bad calls. Keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
