			<personalityDescription>Calixta refuses to quit, no matter how tough the fight gets. She keeps pushing forward, adapting, enduring, and overcoming, because in her mind, the only real defeat is giving up. Calixta says what she means and means what she says. She doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - her words and actions come from a place of honesty, making her a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps going no matter what. Adaptable, unyielding - quitting isn&apos;t an option.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
