			<personalityDescription>Jovana exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment she enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in her world. Jovana is always humming - sometimes a marching cadence, sometimes an old bar song, sometimes a melody no one else recognizes. It&apos;s not loud, just a quiet hum over comms while she lines up a shot or waits for the next engagement. Her lance jokes that if she ever stops humming, that&apos;s when things have really gone bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries weight just by entering a room. Commands presence without trying.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
