			<personalityDescription>Brenna naturally takes control of every situation, expecting others to follow her lead without question. Whether on the battlefield or in command, she believes that authority is best wielded with absolute confidence - and little room for dissent. Brenna doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. She dissects enemy formations, anticipates movements, and executes plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
