			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Feogen has no interest in. He maneuvers through life like a shadow, twisting words, bending loyalties, and setting traps that only he knows how to avoid. Feogen doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs his skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does his interest. </personalityDescription>
