			<personalityDescription>Angelique doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow her down. Every decision, every action is a step toward her goal. While others waver or compromise, she stays locked onto her objective, no matter what it takes to get there. Angelique has seen what happens to those who give up. They don&apos;t get mercy, they don&apos;t get a second chance. They get erased. She fights on because stopping isn&apos;t an option. &quot;Giving up isn&apos;t survival. It&apos;s just choosing to lose slower.&quot; </personalityDescription>
