			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no middle ground with Basri - everything is turned up to eleven. They doesn&apos;t just prepare; they over-prepares. They don&apos;t just act; they go all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, they hasn&apos;t found it yet. Basri has a knack for thinking on their feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, they&apos;re always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 66%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cranks every dial to max. No balance, no brakes.&lt;br&gt;- Sharp tongue, sharper brain. Dangerous in any conversation.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
