			<personalityDescription>Lucy has a knack for making things work, even when they shouldn&apos;t. They jury-rig solutions on the fly, turn disadvantages into advantages, and constantly tweak their gear, always looking for the next breakthrough to give them an edge. Lucy doesn&apos;t just lead - they elevate those around them. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, they make people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes broken things work. Jury-rigs, tweaks, and improvises constantly.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt bark orders - just makes you want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
