			<personalityDescription>Dan knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. He pushes himself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in his mind, every struggle brings him closer to his ultimate goal. Dan has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect him. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to him, it&apos;s all just noise. He does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
