			<personalityDescription>Luiza always wants more - more money, more resources, more power. No matter how much they gain, it&apos;s never enough, and they&apos;ll do whatever it takes to keep stacking up wealth and influence. Luiza doesn&apos;t just hear people - they understand them. They pick up on the emotions others try to hide, offering quiet reassurances or firm guidance exactly when they need it most. </personalityDescription>
