			<personalityDescription>Jason isn&apos;t just a fighter - he&apos;s a chess master with live ammunition. He sets traps, lures enemies into kill zones, and plays mind games that leave opponents scrambling while he calmly executes his next move. Small talk? Useless. Second-guessing orders? Infuriating. Jason&apos;s tolerance for anything that slows him down is nonexistent. He&apos;s not always outright angry, but the scowl, the sharp tone, and the way he glares say more than words ever could. </personalityDescription>
