			<personalityDescription>Experience has made Mariam sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. She reads between the lines, recognizes hidden motives, and plays every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what she is. Mariam storms into battle bare-legged and completely unbothered, treating the absence of pants like it&apos;s a tactical decision. If anyone asks, she&apos;ll claim it&apos;s for better mobility - but really, she just hates the feel of fabric on her legs. &quot;Look, pants slow me down. You want me fast, or you want me fashionable?&quot; </personalityDescription>
