			<personalityDescription>Jim doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects him to stick his neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. Jim&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as his ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, he indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
