			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Mehmood has a reputation for bending the truth, cutting corners, and looking out for himself first. He&apos;s likable, sure, but trusting him? That&apos;s a gamble few are willing to take. Mehmood doesn&apos;t just have a battle plan - he has twelve. If the enemy flanks, if they get pinned down, if weather conditions shift unexpectedly - he&apos;s already thought it through. His lance used to roll their eyes at his paranoia, but after surviving one too many ambushes thanks to Mehmood&apos;s foresight, they don&apos;t complain anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Friendly face, forked tongue. Double-check every word.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
