			<personalityDescription>Slowing down just isn&apos;t in Carolina&apos;s nature. They thrive in constant motion, always chasing the next opportunity, the next fight, the next thrill - because standing still is the only thing that truly unsettles them. Carolina sees the universe as one giant stockpile, and they&apos;re determined to take the biggest share. Every resource and every opportunity is something to be claimed, and they refuse to be left wanting. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stillness is discomfort. Chases motion like its purpose.&lt;br&gt;- Sees the galaxy as a buffet - won&apos;t leave until the table&apos;s cleared.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
