			<personalityDescription>Kim-Hoai never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. Kim-Hoai used to care about how she spoke, about keeping things professional. But war has burned that away. Now, her language is raw, brutal, and honest - because what&apos;s the point in holding back? &quot;I don&apos;t have time for your ****ing optimism. We&apos;re knee-deep in **** and unless you stop talking and start shooting, we&apos;re going to die in it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- By the time you realize the game&apos;s started, they&apos;ve already won it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
