			<personalityDescription>Death is always a step behind, but Tanesha refuses to run. She faces down overwhelming odds with grim determination, knowing that if she falls, it will be on Tanesha&apos;s  terms, with a smoking battlefield left in her wake. Tanesha always seems like she&apos;s one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, her irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Faces death on their own terms. Determined to leave a mark, win or lose.&lt;br&gt;- Complains the whole op. Still finishes first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
