			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Tommy has no patience for it. He throws himself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with him. Tommy&apos;s got a talent for finding loopholes, exploiting technicalities, and twisting situations to his advantage. If someone assumed he&apos;d play fair, that&apos;s on them - he never promised to play by the rules. </personalityDescription>
