			<personalityDescription>Bob acts before thinking, always ready to throw himself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t his strong suit, and keeping Bob in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Bob&apos;s favorite mug has been with him longer than most of his comrades. He&apos;s left planets behind, lost equipment, abandoned people - but this remains. Bob doesn&apos;t talk about where he got it or why he won&apos;t replace it. He just holds it a little tighter on the nights when the war feels particularly close. </personalityDescription>
