			<personalityDescription>Jamee&apos;s drive is more than ambition - it&apos;s an unshakable force. She doesn&apos;t just work hard; she outworks everyone, refusing to rest until she&apos;s accomplished what she set out to do. Jamee refuses to see a fight as unwinnable. Outnumbered? That just means more targets. Outgunned? They&apos;ll run out of ammo first. Her confidence is unshakable, even when reality says otherwise. &quot;We just need one good break. And trust me - it&apos;s coming.&quot; </personalityDescription>
