			<personalityDescription>Nyet-Fah has never met a fight she didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, she runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Nyet-Fah always takes the time to think about how her actions affect others. Whether it&apos;s checking in on her comrades, giving credit where it&apos;s due, or offering help without being asked, she makes sure people feel valued and respected. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps an eye on the squad - remembers who skipped rations, who didn&apos;t sleep.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
