			<personalityDescription>Abhijana&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. He tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that his loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. Abhijana doesn&apos;t worry about not having the right tools - he makes do. A broken weapon, a missing component, an unexpected failure? He&apos;s already rigging up a solution with whatever he can scavenge. &quot;You&apos;d be amazed what you can build with a little ingenuity and a complete lack of better options.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes you feel seen - until you realize you were just a mark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
