			<personalityDescription>Song-Yun&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Song-Yun doesn&apos;t flinch under fire, doesn&apos;t panic when missiles rain down - but her fingers tell a different story. Her nails are jagged, bitten down to near nothing, the casualty of endless waiting, briefing delays, and long hours in the scrum. It&apos;s not fear, she insists. Just something to do while the next battle looms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
