			<personalityDescription>Carlitos doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. He thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to him, caution is just another word for hesitation. &quot;This reminds me of a fight we had on Kelenfold. Same terrain, same bad odds.&quot; Carlitos always has a story, always a comparison to something before. His lance listens - sometimes for wisdom, sometimes just to hear about a time when things weren&apos;t so bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushed by risk, not tactics. Caution dismissed as weakness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
