			<personalityDescription>Mohala has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. He can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get his way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where he wants them to go. Mohala almost never calls his teammates by their actual names. The rookie pilot? &apos;Hotshot.&apos; The team&apos;s allocated tech? &apos;Sparky.&apos; The commander? &apos;Big Boss.&apos; Half the unit has stopped correcting him, because by the time they do, he&apos;s already come up with another one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Gets agreement without argument. Smooth operator.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
