			<personalityDescription>Julie does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. She isn&apos;t lazy - she just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. Even in the heat of war, Julie never loses sight of the people fighting beside her. Whether it&apos;s sharing supplies, covering for a comrade&apos;s mistake, or simply checking in, she proves that true leadership starts with empathy. </personalityDescription>
