			<personalityDescription>Teddy acts first and deals with the consequences later. He thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Teddy is always ready for action, diving headfirst into challenges with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s a new mission, a tough fight, or a high-stakes gamble, he thrives on the thrill of what&apos;s next. </personalityDescription>
