			<personalityDescription>Ciri sees every interaction as a transaction, and she always makes sure she comes out ahead. If there&apos;s a choice between helping others or helping herself, there&apos;s never really a choice at all. No unnecessary attachments, no redundant weapons, no fancy tech. Ciri keeps her loadout simple - because simple works. &quot;You don&apos;t need a dozen backup plans,&quot; she says, securing her sidearm. &quot;You need one that won&apos;t fail.&quot; It&apos;s an efficient mindset, but some worry it&apos;s less about discipline and more about not wanting to get attached to anything. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move is calculated for personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
