			<personalityDescription>Julita doesn&apos;t just fight to win - they fight to annihilate. Enemies aren&apos;t obstacles to be overcome; they&apos;re targets to be erased, and they won&apos;t stop until the battlefield is silent. Julita doesn&apos;t argue - they explain, as if talking to a child who just can&apos;t grasp the obvious. Every interaction feels like a lesson, delivered with an exasperated sigh and the unshakable certainty that they&apos;re always right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t just win - erases. Only satisfied when nothing is left alive.&lt;br&gt;- Every correction feels like a lecture. Grates on nerves fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
