			<personalityDescription>Gerrit sees rules as obstacles, not boundaries. If there&apos;s a shortcut to be taken or a loophole to exploit, he&apos;ll find it - ethics and fairness be damned. If Gerrit&apos;s on your side today, don&apos;t count on him tomorrow. He&apos;s an expert at playing both sides, shifting allegiances, and making sure he always lands on top - no matter who he has to betray. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats rules like suggestions. Never plays clean.&lt;br&gt;- Bet on them betraying you. The only sure thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
