			<personalityDescription>Carina talks a good game about loyalty and teamwork, but at the end of the day, they&apos;re only loyal to themself. They know exactly when to walk away, who to throw under the bus, and how to spin things so they always land on their feet. No matter how hardened the universe tries to make them, Carina refuses to shut themself off from others. They carry their burdens as if they were their own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty ends the moment the benefit does.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t harden - chooses to feel. Risky, but admirable.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
