			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Deniz&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. Deniz isn&apos;t the type to shoot a retreating enemy, nor does she take pleasure in victory. She fights only as much as necessary. &quot;Not every enemy deserves to die. Some of them are just trying to survive - same as us.&quot; </personalityDescription>
