			<personalityDescription>Stephanie knows how to work a room, flip a deal, and turn a conversation in her favor. Whether she&apos;s negotiating a contract or outwitting an opponent, she never wastes a word - or an opportunity. Nothing moves Stephanie anymore. Loss, suffering, and chaos are just background noise, and she doesn&apos;t waste energy pretending to care. Whether someone lives or dies, wins or loses - it&apos;s all the same in the end. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows how to twist a conversation into a contract.&lt;br&gt;- Watches suffering like it&apos;s weather - present, distant, irrelevant.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
