			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Halina isn&apos;t loud about her support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - her strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. Halina doesn&apos;t explain herself because she knows that if people knew the truth, they&apos;d never trust her again. Her motives are buried under layers of necessity and survival. &quot;You don&apos;t need to know why I&apos;m doing this. You just need to decide if you&apos;re coming with me or not.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows what you need before you ask. Delivers, quiet and sure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
