			<personalityDescription>Ryann refuses to back down, no matter the circumstances. Once she sets her mind on something, there&apos;s no changing it - whether that&apos;s holding the line in battle or refusing to admit she was wrong. Experience has made Ryann sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. She reads between the lines, recognizes hidden motives, and plays every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what she is. </personalityDescription>
