			<personalityDescription>Awareness is K&apos;wratse&apos;s greatest weapon. She reads people like a battlefield, catching the smallest shifts in expression or intent, ensuring she&apos;s never the one taken by surprise. After seeing too much death and betrayal, K&apos;wratse has stopped caring. She doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In her mind, caring only leads to pain. </personalityDescription>
