			<personalityDescription>Every move Wu makes is intentional. He never fights just for the sake of it - he maneuvers, controls engagements, and dictates the pace of battle, making sure every skirmish ends on his terms. The universe is broken, and Wu knows it. He doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick his neck out for anyone. As far as he&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
