			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Lily has no interest in. She maneuvers through life like a shadow, twisting words, bending loyalties, and setting traps that only she knows how to avoid. Lily&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. </personalityDescription>
