			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Mehdi knows hesitation gets people killed. He acts fast, takes risks, and makes hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In his mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. &quot;We&apos;re walking into a trap,&quot; Mehdi mutters as the mission briefing ends. &quot;How do you know?&quot; someone asks. &quot;Because we&apos;re still breathing - means the universe isn&apos;t done screwing with us yet.&quot; No matter the odds, no matter how good things look, Mehdi is always prepared for something to go wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves fast. Makes the call before anyone else dares.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
