			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Jim&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s his ability to manipulate. He spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, he&apos;s already taken what he wanted. Jim has quick hands and an even quicker eye for opportunity. Whether it&apos;s skimming a bit off the top, slipping parts off a salvage pile, or &quot;borrowing&quot; a &apos;Mek when no one&apos;s looking, he always finds a way to take what he wants. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;br&gt;- Fingers faster than most can blink - don&apos;t turn your back on this one.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
