			<personalityDescription>Angela doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets her more. She plays on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Angela is the one who profits most. Angela doesn&apos;t fight like a brute, because she refuses to believe war is just violence for violence&apos;s sake. If she doesn&apos;t turn it into something greater, into art, then what is it? Just murder. And she can&apos;t let herself believe that&apos;s all there is. </personalityDescription>
