			<personalityDescription>Pinar doesn&apos;t just win - she makes sure everyone knows she won. She taunts enemies, overplays her hand, and takes flashy risks just for the sake of proving she can. She&apos;s good - she just might not be as good as she thinks. Pinar has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, she always finds a way to make sure her time and effort result in cold, hard cash. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Wins loud. Risks big to prove a point - might not be worth it.&lt;br&gt;- Always walks away with more than they came in with. Smiles while others scrape.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
