			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Gaberiela&apos;s strengths. He speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then he considers himself a saint. Gaberiela moves with deadly precision once he&apos;s actually in the fight - but getting to that point is another story. Tripping over his own boots, misjudging doorways, and misfiring controls are just part of the package. &quot;I&apos;m great under pressure. Getting there&apos;s the problem.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
