			<personalityDescription>Why fight when you can talk your way out - or better yet, talk your enemy into fighting for you? Allsun knows how to turn a phrase, spin a deal, and leave everyone thinking they got the better end of the bargain. Allsun doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. They weave half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while they walk away unscathed - and usually richer. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Talks others into doing their dirty work. Master of the soft sell.&lt;br&gt;- Words over weapons. Turns enemies on each other, walks off clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
