			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>People want to believe Hyeon-seok, and that&apos;s the danger. He sounds sincere, looks reliable, and acts like he has your back - until the moment it benefits him to do otherwise. Hyeon-seok never trusts supply lines. He&apos;s got ration bars stuffed in his boots, emergency packs taped onto his helmet, and a hidden stash of canned food somewhere in the barracks. &quot;You never know when things go bad,&quot; he says. The way he says it makes people wonder if he&apos;s speaking from experience. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sounds like a friend. Acts like a liability.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
