			<personalityDescription>Marta doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - she does what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. Marta doesn&apos;t just hear people - she listens. Whether it&apos;s a new strategy, a fresh perspective, or a hard truth, she takes in information without letting pride or stubbornness get in the way of growth. </personalityDescription>
