			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ehsan isn&apos;t just skilled - he&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake he won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Ehsan&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping him alive. Ehsan thrives in the chaos of war, treating every mission as a personal challenge. The more dangerous the objective, the bigger his grin. &quot;Oh, this is a bad idea? Good. That makes it more fun.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
