			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Faruq doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when he&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - he&apos;ll take his time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. Faruq will absolutely fight in whatever conditions he has to, but that doesn&apos;t mean he won&apos;t voice his disappointment the entire time. Whether it&apos;s loadout choices, terrain, or enemy tactics, he has opinions. &quot;You call this a firing position? No cover, bad angles, and don&apos;t get me started on the damn wind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows their lane. Won&apos;t leave it. Won&apos;t look up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
