			<personalityDescription>Andy knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll take the best deal for himself. He&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, he&apos;ll make sure he walks away with the biggest share. Whether it&apos;s scrubbing down his gear, wiping every speck of dust off his boots, or meticulously cleaning his bunk after a long mission, Andy keeps everything spotless. He believes that &quot;clean gear is reliable gear,&quot; and to his credit, he looks good. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 30%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
