			<personalityDescription>Danish never hesitates to take the lead, charging headfirst into danger with unshakable confidence. He believes that decisive action wins battles and refuses to back down, even when the odds are stacked against him. Danish doesn&apos;t believe in rules - only results. He&apos;ll step on allies, deceive enemies, and manipulate anyone in his way, all with a cold efficiency that leaves no room for doubt or regret. </personalityDescription>
