			<personalityDescription>Lamara has a gift for understanding situations at a glance, spotting the key players and seeing paths to victory that others overlook. Whether in strategy, diplomacy, or battle, her ability to read the moment gives her an undeniable edge. Lamara doesn&apos;t panic, but she&apos;s noticeably uneasy in large, open spaces. She sticks to shadows, corners, anywhere that makes the world feel smaller. &quot;I&apos;d rather not stand in the middle of this room. You never know who&apos;s watching.&quot; </personalityDescription>
