			<personalityDescription>Tavrion makes it seem like he&apos;s a team player, but everything he does is carefully crafted to benefit himself first. He&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for him, making sure that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the one standing on top. Tavrion doesn&apos;t just lead - he inspires. Whether through quiet words of reassurance or a rallying cry before battle, he fuels those around him with the drive to keep moving, keep fighting, and keep believing in victory. </personalityDescription>
