			<personalityDescription>Vishwanata doesn&apos;t coddle - he drives people forward. His words are sharp, his expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around him survive. If he&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because he refuses to let them fail. While others shout over each other, Vishwanata waits. He listens, thinks, then speaks carefully. &quot;We engage now, we overextend. We wait ten seconds, we flank.&quot; He refuses to let adrenaline dictate his decisions, and while it frustrates more aggressive warriors, his lance has learned to trust him. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, expects more - pressure makes diamonds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
