			<personalityDescription>Nothing slows Nabeeha down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. She grinds forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in her mind, stopping is just another way of dying. Nabeeha doesn&apos;t intentionally ignore responsibilities - she just gets caught up in her own world. Whether it&apos;s distractions, forgetfulness, or a lack of organization, things tend to slip through the cracks more often than they should. </personalityDescription>
