			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Xandra can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. They spin stories, plays up their credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, they&apos;re long gone. Xandra is miserable in extreme conditions, but they always find ways to cope. On an ice world? They&apos;re hoarding heat packs in their boots. Stuck in a dust storm? They&apos;re wearing a scarf like some kind of post-apocalyptic bandit. Their ability to adapt is almost as impressive as their ability to suffer loudly. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Could sell ice to polar troops and vanish before the melt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
