			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Filipe refuses to be either. He rushes headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Filipe never stands still. If Filipe&apos;s on your side today, don&apos;t count on him tomorrow. He&apos;s an expert at playing both sides, shifting allegiances, and making sure he always lands on top - no matter who he has to betray. </personalityDescription>
