			<personalityDescription>If Mendia isn&apos;t in control, she isn&apos;t comfortable. She orchestrates every move, dictates every step, and ensures that nothing happens without her approval - because, in her mind, no one else can be trusted to do it right. Mendia is never satisfied - her hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. She devours opportunities, crushes competition, and takes what she wants without hesitation. Sooner or later, even her allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. </personalityDescription>
