			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, El-Fatih is already halfway through it. He thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. If El-Fatih&apos;s doing something, everyone is going to know about it. He doubles down on every decision, throws himself into everything at full speed, and refuses to settle for anything that isn&apos;t over-the-top. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Everything&apos;s a performance. Goes full tilt, no matter the stakes.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
