			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Naja is the spark that ignites every situation. Her charisma, ambition, and relentless drive make her impossible to ignore, drawing people in and pushing events forward with sheer force of will. Naja&apos;s glasses are always slipping because she&apos;s always reading - contract clauses, supply manifests, tech manuals in languages she doesn&apos;t actually speak. If there&apos;s a scam in a deal, she&apos;ll find it. If there&apos;s a loophole in a contract, she&apos;ll close it. Her glasses may be old, scratched, and constantly need an adjustment, but they never miss a detail. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brings heat and motion - people follow whether they mean to or not.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
