			<personalityDescription>Luu-Danh isn&apos;t satisfied with just getting by - they want more. Whether it&apos;s climbing the ranks, commanding their own unit, or carving their name into history, they&apos;re always pushing forward, never content to stay in one place for long. Luu-Danh hates open spaces because they know exactly how fast things can go wrong when there&apos;s no cover, no safety, nowhere to hide. They avoid crowds because they&apos;re unpredictable, uncontrollable, and just as dangerous in their own way. &quot;Too many eyes, too many exits, too many places to die without seeing it coming.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 66%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never satisfied. Always reaching for more - rank, power, legacy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
