			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Thuy-An is already halfway through it. She thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. There&apos;s no room for doubt in Thuy-An&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
