			<personalityDescription>People trust Zi-jun because they&apos;re real. They don&apos;t fake emotions, don&apos;t manipulate, and don&apos;t care about putting on an act. Their honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes them both respected and reliable. Zi-jun reroutes coffee machine settings so they all dispense decaf, rearranges locker labels just slightly, and convinces rookies that &quot;JumpShip gravity loss training&quot; involves sprinting toward a bulkhead wall. No one&apos;s safe - but somehow, they all love them for it. </personalityDescription>
