			<personalityDescription>For Chana, hesitation is just another form of failure. She throws herself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, she never slows down. People exhaust her, and trust is a luxury she can&apos;t afford. Chana keeps her distance, avoids unnecessary interactions, and only engages when absolutely necessary. Solitude isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s survival. </personalityDescription>
