			<personalityDescription>Dan-zu has been battered, broken, and left for dead more times than they can count - but they&apos;re still here. Pain, loss, and suffering don&apos;t slow them down; they fuel them, turning every setback into another reason to keep fighting. Dan-zu operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, they&apos;re playing it safe; the next, they&apos;re charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with them is a challenge - predicting them is impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pain fuels the fire. Still here, still fighting.&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
