			<personalityDescription>The more dangerous the path, the more certain Lynn is that it&apos;s the right one. She moves forward without fear, seeing every unknown as a puzzle to solve, a victory to claim, or a story to tell later. Lynn didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. She&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. She trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure she&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. </personalityDescription>
