			<personalityDescription>Georgiy sees morality as a luxury they can&apos;t afford. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient way to get ahead - no matter how brutal - they&apos;ll take it without hesitation or regret. Georgiy&apos;s not above bending protocols if it makes life easier for the team. They&apos;ll reroute supplies, fudge maintenance reports, and cut corners where it counts - so long as the outcome works in their favor. &quot;If you didn&apos;t see it happen, it didn&apos;t happen. That&apos;s how paperwork works.&quot; </personalityDescription>
