			<personalityDescription>Nhu doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. She dissects enemy formations, anticipates movements, and executes plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, she&apos;s already won. &quot;Do I look like a magician?&quot; &quot;You want it done when? Hah.&quot; &quot;Sure, I&apos;ll pull that out of my magic supply crate full of things we don&apos;t have.&quot; Nhu has a standard rotation of responses to requests, all variations of &apos;You&apos;re not getting what you want.&apos; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy-first operator - kills with planning, not firepower.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
