			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Soo-Ying&apos;s world. She delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, she makes sure they know it. Soo-Ying has seen rules bend and break in the face of war. She&apos;s watched people compromise their values to survive. She refuses. She follows a code because if she doesn&apos;t, then nothing means anything anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
