			<personalityDescription>Bill doesn&apos;t just lead - they elevate those around them. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, they make people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. When Bill explains a process, they do it slowly, clearly, and with no room for misunderstanding. &quot;You will disconnect the relay. You will not touch the exposed wiring. If you do, you will die.&quot; Whether they&apos;re training rookies or giving mission updates, their methodical speech ensures that no one can claim they didn&apos;t hear them. </personalityDescription>
