			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a bad idea, Tyler will be the first to try it. He hates waiting, hates planning, and definitely hates being told to slow down - because he always believes the best way forward is straight through the enemy. Tyler hates technology. &quot;You think this reactor is stable? Please. The second one capacitor misaligns, boom - you&apos;re debris.&quot; He&apos;s the best at his job, but he&apos;s also convinced everything remotely high tech is secretly trying to kill everyone. </personalityDescription>
