			<personalityDescription>Small talk? Useless. Second-guessing orders? Infuriating. Derrick&apos;s tolerance for anything that slows him down is nonexistent. He&apos;s not always outright angry, but the scowl, the sharp tone, and the way he glares say more than words ever could. Derrick might be laid back or unfocused when things are normal, but when things start falling apart, he&apos;s suddenly the most competent person in the room. No hesitation, no wasted energy - just pure execution. &quot;You can freak out after we fix this. Right now, we get it done.&quot; </personalityDescription>
