			<personalityDescription>Roberto&apos;s got a talent for finding loopholes, exploiting technicalities, and twisting situations to his advantage. If someone assumed he&apos;d play fair, that&apos;s on them - he never promised to play by the rules. Roberto refuses to sign off on anything until he&apos;s personally stress-tested it beyond reasonable limits. If a component is rated for ten tons of pressure, he&apos;s testing it at fifteen. If a system shouldn&apos;t overheat, he&apos;s finding out what temperature actually kills it. &quot;Better here than in the field.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Slips through cracks and loopholes like it&apos;s a game.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
