			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Hüseyin&apos;s tone alone is enough to set people on edge. Whether it&apos;s the slow, deliberate way they correct others or the way they smirk when they struggle, they make it painfully clear that they think they&apos;re leagues ahead of everyone else. Hüseyin makes jokes because if they stop, everything starts feeling too real. They can&apos;t fix the shortages, the losses, or the slow collapse of everything they&apos;ve built - but they can make people laugh, even if only for a moment. And sometimes, that&apos;s the only thing keeping them all from breaking. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Even praise feels like punishment. Might make enemies just by talking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
