			<personalityDescription>Sawada is always working an angle, always looking for a way to manipulate the situation to her advantage. She plays people like a chessboard, making sure they never realize they were just another piece in her game. Wealth, power, and influence mean little to Sawada if she can&apos;t use them to help those around her. She sees generosity as more than just kindness - it&apos;s a responsibility, one she takes seriously. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always scheming. Moves people like pieces, stays three steps out of sight.&lt;br&gt;- Treats generosity like duty - takes it as seriously as rank.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
