			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Ainsley refuses to bend. They will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in their mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Ainsley believes the best way to handle a crisis is to prevent it before it happens. They stay ahead of the curve, anticipating challenges and solving problems before anyone else even sees them coming. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Solves problems before they exist. Lives ahead of the curve.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
