			<personalityDescription>Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Alice. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining their gear, or following through on commitments, they tend to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. Walk into the depot, and you will be greeted. Loudly. &quot;Ah-HA! The HERO of the battlefield RETURNS to my humble domain! What grand treasures do you seek today, O&apos; Mighty Warrior?&quot; It&apos;s impossible to take them seriously - but it&apos;s also impossible to leave in a bad mood. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 36%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Needs a babysitter, not a command.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
