			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Felicity has no patience for hesitation. She faces overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop her. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. Felicity&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just her skill, but her ability to think. She sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when she moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats fear like weakness. Smiles at overwhelming odds. Borderline reckless.&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
