			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Marjon has no patience for it. She throws herself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with her. Marjon never misses an opportunity. She&apos;s quick to turn setbacks into advantages, shifting gears effortlessly when a better option appears. If someone hesitates, she&apos;ll already be three moves ahead, making the most of their hesitation. </personalityDescription>
