			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ciler charges headfirst into danger without hesitation, trusting instinct and luck to carry her through. Whether it&apos;s an impossible maneuver or a head-on assault, she never stops to ask if it&apos;s a good idea - only if it&apos;s exciting. Ciler can&apos;t give a briefing, tell a story, or even trash-talk an enemy without animated, sweeping gestures. She&apos;s nearly smacked her own comrades more than once while explaining a maneuver mid-battle. She fights just as expressively - every reload, every charge, every headshot somehow feels like it belongs in an action holo. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes into danger without pause. Seeks excitement, not survival.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
