			<personalityDescription>No matter how many times Primo gets knocked down, he gets back up stronger. He takes every hit, every loss, every failure, and turns it into fuel to keep moving forward. Primo has a report ready to go, job fully handled, and manifests double-checked-but he won&apos;t submit anything without someone approving it first. &quot;Just want to make sure it&apos;s right,&quot; he says, waiting for a nod before proceeding. It slows things down, but he can&apos;t help it. </personalityDescription>
