			<personalityDescription>Lyubov doesn&apos;t just have confidence - she has certainty. In her mind, she&apos;s always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. Lyubov&apos;s clumsiness isn&apos;t a joke to her - it&apos;s a source of constant frustration. She&apos;s tired of being the one who causes problems, tired of hearing the sighs when something crashes to the floor behind her. &quot;I don&apos;t need people to laugh it off. I need to stop screwing things up.&quot; </personalityDescription>
