			<personalityDescription>Yoon-Hae doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. Yoon-Hae&apos;s loyalty is measured in cash, and the only flag she follows is the one that pays her the most. If the contract is right, she&apos;ll fight for anyone, against anyone - principles be damned. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;br&gt;- Will shoot for anyone if the money&apos;s good. Morals not included.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
