			<personalityDescription>Gia-Long knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll take the best deal for himself. He&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, he&apos;ll make sure he walks away with the biggest share. Gia-Long doesn&apos;t whine, grumble, or overreact. If something is bad, he deals with it. If something is really bad, he deals with it harder. &quot;Yeah. It&apos;s bad. So let&apos;s fix it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
