			<personalityDescription>Henry doesn&apos;t just want to prove himself - he needs to. He throws himself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show he&apos;s worthy of something bigger. The bigger the crowd, the more alive Henry feels. He moves effortlessly from conversation to conversation, making fast friends, sparking rivalries for fun, and ensuring that no one forgets his presence. </personalityDescription>
