			<personalityDescription>Gemie-Val acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, she prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to her own detriment. Gemie-Val doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps before looking. Trusts instinct over outcome. Risk to self and mission.&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
