			<personalityDescription>Heidi doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs her skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does her interest. Heidi won&apos;t let anything be dismissed as &apos;good enough&apos;. Every procedure, every decision, every single mistake gets analyzed in-depth. Some people find it exhausting, but they also know that when Heidi reviews something, nothing gets missed. </personalityDescription>
