			<personalityDescription>Homer has no patience for nonsense. He cuts through distractions and emotions, keeping his mind locked onto the mission. While others get lost in doubt or debate, he moves forward with ruthless efficiency. Homer doesn&apos;t believe in titles. The lead mechanic is &apos;Grease,&apos; the MedTech is &apos;Patches,&apos; and the newest recruit is &apos;Grass&apos; until they earn something better. It&apos;s all part of the company&apos;s culture now - at this point, even he probably doesn&apos;t remember their real names. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No time for drama. Mission takes priority over everything.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
