			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s determination, and then there&apos;s Kinei. Once she makes a decision, no amount of logic, pleading, or even superior orders will make her budge. Whether it&apos;s admirable or infuriating depends on who you ask. While others waste time with diplomacy, Kinei gets straight to the point. She values efficiency over politeness and doesn&apos;t believe in dancing around the truth. Some find her approach refreshing - others just find it frustrating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Logic bounces off. Orders ignored if they conflict with conviction.&lt;br&gt;- Talks like time is short and patience shorter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
