			<personalityDescription>Compassion is a weakness Peder can&apos;t afford. They don&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In their mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make them hesitate. Peder is at their absolute best when things are at their worst. When deadlines stack up, when systems crash, when everyone else is panicking, they&apos;re calmly fixing six things at once. &quot;Crisis? Nah, this is when I get stuff done.&quot; </personalityDescription>
