			<personalityDescription>Bing-Lin is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. She looks out for her allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. Bing-Lin doesn&apos;t just talk about what&apos;s happening now - she always finds a way to bring up what used to be. &quot;Things were different before the company got big.&quot; &quot;You should&apos;ve seen the old crew - real professionals.&quot; It&apos;s never clear if she misses the past or just refuses to let it go. </personalityDescription>
