			<personalityDescription>Once, Ambroise might have wanted more, but now? He&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Ambroise has long since stopped caring. Ambroise doesn&apos;t just complain - he fixes things. If something isn&apos;t up to his personal standard, he&apos;ll redo it from scratch. &quot;Look, I don&apos;t trust anyone else to do it right. Just let me handle it before I lose my mind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
