			<personalityDescription>Romylee&apos;s mind is razor-sharp, cutting through noise and distractions to find the truth hidden beneath. She notices patterns, anticipates outcomes, and always seems to be one step ahead of the game. Romylee believes that strength isn&apos;t just about winning battles - it&apos;s about lifting others up. She offers encouragement when morale is low, steps in when someone struggles, and always ensures those around her feel seen and valued. </personalityDescription>
