			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Margarida avoids - it&apos;s something she seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, She meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Margarida never stands too close to a &apos;Mek, never trusts that they&apos;re fully powered down, never walks beneath one without her pulse spiking. They&apos;re too big, too unnatural, too much like monsters pretending to be machines. &quot;I don&apos;t care if it&apos;s offline. That thing&apos;s one bad signal away from flattening this entire place.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Seeks out risk. Smiles at impossible odds, eager for the test.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
