			<personalityDescription>Monzaemon carries themself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, they radiate a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. Nothing really excites Monzaemon, and nothing really bothers them either. They do their job, follow orders, and go through the motions, but there&apos;s no passion behind it - just routine. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Calm assurance. Inspires teammates, unnerves enemies. Confidence backed by presence.&lt;br&gt;- Clock punches in, clock punches out - soul never showed up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
