			<personalityDescription>Paddy knows exactly what to say and do to get people to act in his favor. Whether it&apos;s flattery, subtle pressure, or outright deception, he shapes situations to his advantage without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been played. Paddy doesn&apos;t slow down, doesn&apos;t stop, doesn&apos;t rest. Whether in battle, in business, or in pursuit of power, he demands more - more resources, more control, more everything - because anything less feels like losing. </personalityDescription>
