			<personalityDescription>Sean clutches onto everything he can get his hands on, unwilling to share or let anything slip through his fingers. He&apos;ll betray, deceive, and exploit if it means keeping himself ahead - because in his mind, scarcity is just another battlefield. Sean may not be frontline, but he sure acts like it. He keeps an entire stockpile of sidearms, knives, and probably some heavy weapons in places they absolutely shouldn&apos;t be. &quot;What? You don&apos;t have a contingency stash?&quot; </personalityDescription>
