			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, Rossano is already in motion. He doesn&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - Rossano weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Rossano doesn&apos;t just think ahead - he sees ahead. He plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to his advantage, making sure every move he makes strengthens his position while others scramble to keep up. </personalityDescription>
