			<personalityDescription>Corrianne always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear she thinks she&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, she has a way of making others feel small without ever raising her voice. Corrianne doesn&apos;t just go into battle - she does it with a playlist. Whether it&apos;s heavy metal, modern symphonies, or classical rock, she swears the right song keeps her in the zone. Her lance is used to seeing her nodding along mid-skirmish, completely unfazed by the surrounding chaos. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smirks before they speak. You know the tone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
