			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, William acts. He doesn&apos;t wait for orders, approval, or the perfect moment - he takes control, makes the call, and ensures things get done his way. William doesn&apos;t make a big deal about watching over his team - he just does it. Covering flanks, blocking shots, dragging a wounded ally to safety - he never talks about it. &quot;Just keep moving,&quot; he mutters, holding the line without expecting thanks. </personalityDescription>
