			<personalityDescription>Mark refuses to waver, no matter the odds. Once he sets a goal, he sees it through with unshakable determination, standing firm even when everything around him is falling apart. Mark never lets things go, but he doesn&apos;t always act on it directly. Instead, he makes snide comments, &quot;forgets&quot; to relay important information, and subtly undermines people in ways that are just deniable enough to avoid confrontation. </personalityDescription>
