			<personalityDescription>Eric lives in the now, always moving, always deciding on the fly. Whether it&apos;s a split-second gamble or an uncalculated risk, he thrives in the rush of immediate action - consequences can wait. Eric has an uncanny ability to turn even the worst situations into financial gain. Whether it&apos;s salvaging wrecks, flipping assets, or cutting deals in the middle of chaos, he always ensures he walks away richer than he started. </personalityDescription>
