			<personalityDescription>Be never second-guesses themself - why would they, when they&apos;re always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to their will. Be doesn&apos;t stop. No matter how bad things get, no matter how many people fall around them, they keep going. &quot;Retreat?&quot; they scoff. &quot;You can retreat if you want. I&apos;ll be here when you decide to push forward again.&quot; </personalityDescription>
