			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Cal&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making his presence known, he moves through life like he&apos;s already won. Cal wears his confidence like a badge of honor, parading his victories with flair and dismissing setbacks as temporary blips. His unwavering belief in his own prowess often blinds him to potential dangers, even as he dazzles onlookers with his bold, if misguided, bravado. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 38%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fire-eyed. Acts like the outcome&apos;s already certain - and it favors them.&lt;br&gt;- Flaunts wins, shrugs off losses. Blind spots hidden behind bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
