			<personalityDescription>Some people accept their place in the universe - Fuh-Sheng refuses to. She dreams big, fights hard, and never stops striving for something greater, no matter how distant or impossible it may seem. Fuh-Sheng can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. She spins stories, plays up her credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, she&apos;s long gone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects complacency. Dreams big, fights bigger - refuses to settle.&lt;br&gt;- Could sell ice to polar troops and vanish before the melt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
