			<personalityDescription>Danny builds his life on lies, and he&apos;s good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game he plays. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. Danny operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lives in a house of cards and dares you to knock.&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
