			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, and impossible odds mean nothing to Leonora. She will fight until the mission is done, even if it means crawling from the wreckage to finish the job with her bare hands. Leonora says exactly what&apos;s on her mind, with no concern for sugarcoating or social niceties. If the truth is harsh, so be it - she sees no point in dressing it up. </personalityDescription>
