			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Brandon pushes ahead. Risk doesn&apos;t concern him, and consequences are an afterthought - if there&apos;s a way through, he&apos;ll find it, no matter how dangerous the path. Brandon knows that power isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s taken. He maneuvers people like game pieces, striking deals with one hand and slipping a dagger in with the other. If there&apos;s an opportunity to get ahead, he&apos;ll take it before anyone else even sees it coming. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes where others pause. Sees risk, ignores it. Goal matters more.&lt;br&gt;- Takes power, doesn&apos;t ask for it. Strikes fast, betrays faster.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
