			<personalityDescription>Knaval says exactly what&apos;s on her mind, with no concern for sugarcoating or social niceties. If the truth is harsh, so be it - she sees no point in dressing it up. Knaval can&apos;t not try to break things down. She spends downtime solving riddles, tweaking battle plans, or picking apart mission briefings like they&apos;re crossword clues. &quot;It&apos;s just a simple recon op, Knaval.&quot; She shakes her head. &quot;That&apos;s what they want you to think.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t mince words - just carves straight to the bone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
