			<personalityDescription>Iongi sees every situation as a puzzle to be solved, every person as a piece to be placed. They never act without purpose, ensuring that each decision moves them one step closer to their ultimate goal. Iongi doesn&apos;t just fear fire - they&apos;ve watched it consume people. They&apos;ve heard the screams, smelled the smoke, seen what&apos;s left after an Inferno. And they know that if they ever ends up in that situation, there won&apos;t be anything left to save. &quot;I&apos;d take a bullet over fire. A hundred times over. At least a bullet leaves something behind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats people like game pieces. Every action serves a greater plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
