			<personalityDescription>Death is always a step behind, but Nicola refuses to run. They faces down overwhelming odds with grim determination, knowing that if they fall, it will be on Nicola&apos;s  terms, with a smoking battlefield left in their wake. Nicola is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. Their tactics shift constantly, their decisions keep enemies guessing, and their sheer momentum makes them nearly impossible to stop once they set their sights on something. </personalityDescription>
