			<personalityDescription>Don knows how to work a room, flip a deal, and turn a conversation in his favor. Whether he&apos;s negotiating a contract or outwitting an opponent, he never wastes a word - or an opportunity. Once, Don might have cared. Now, he just drifts. Wars rage, alliances shift, people come and go, and none of it moves him. He does what&apos;s necessary to get by, but passion and purpose are long-forgotten luxuries. </personalityDescription>
