			<personalityDescription>Mehdi makes it all look easy. Whether it&apos;s navigating a battlefield, negotiating a deal, or fixing a &apos;Mek with limited resources, they handle it with skill, confidence, and just the right amount of flair. Mehdi keeps their words fast, their thoughts faster, because if they slow down, the memories catch up. The losses, the failures, the ghosts of voices they&apos;ll never hear again. So they keep talking - because silence is worse. </personalityDescription>
