			<personalityDescription>Hanoona lives for the thrill of the impossible, drawn to challenges that make others hesitate. Rules, limits, and second thoughts don&apos;t interest them - only the rush of proving that nothing is beyond their reach. Hanoona never plays fair - they play to win. Every promise, every alliance, every deal is just another tool in their arsenal, and they always ensure they come out ahead. </personalityDescription>
