			<personalityDescription>Stella moves through life with an uncanny sense of knowing exactly what to do. Whether in the heat of battle or a tense negotiation, they read the moment, trusts their gut, and makes the right call before anyone else sees the play. Stella has hidden stockpiles everywhere. Rations in the storage bay, extra weapons in unmarked crates, an escape route planned for any disaster. People think they&apos;re paranoid - until the first real crisis hits. &quot;What do you mean you didn&apos;t pack three months&apos; worth of emergency food?&quot; </personalityDescription>
