			<personalityDescription>People trust Kristian because they know he&apos;s real. He doesn&apos;t put on a facade or tell people what they want to hear - he tells them what they need to hear. His sincerity makes him a reliable friend and an unwavering ally. Kristian personalizes things because he knows how quickly people disappear. How fast their names are forgotten. If he can&apos;t control anything else, he can at least leave behind something unique. If the war erases everything else, at least someone might one day see his mark and remember he existed. </personalityDescription>
