			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Ghaidaa - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. &quot;Ghaidaa, patch up that report.&quot; She grabs a literal patch kit. &quot;Ghaidaa, hand me that tool.&quot; She places it directly in someone&apos;s palm. &quot;Ghaidaa, fix this system real quick.&quot; &quot;Define quick,&quot; she responds, already pulling out a diagnostic report. She&apos;s not trying to be difficult - she just needs precision. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Greed isnt a flaw here - its the mission.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
