			<personalityDescription>Rhys exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment he enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in his world. Rhys doesn&apos;t need recognition - he just wants his people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, he offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. </personalityDescription>
