			<personalityDescription>Narciso sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. He takes what he needs, wrings every ounce of value out of those around him, and discards them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. Narciso doesn&apos;t just believe in the Black Marauder - he documents. If there&apos;s a story, he&apos;s heard it. If there&apos;s an anomaly in the records, he&apos;s marked it. He has an entire hidden file of unexplained incidents. &quot;Coincidence? You really think this many vanishings are coincidence?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats people like tools - breaks them, bins them, moves on.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
