			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Juan is already halfway through it. He thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Juan believes in his unit and makes sure they know it. Whether it&apos;s a few words of confidence before a mission or lifting someone up after a failure, he always pushes others to be their best. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps morale high - knows when to speak and what to say.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
