			<personalityDescription>Loyalty is just a word, and Tomik has no use for it. They lie, scheme, and betray without hesitation, using anyone and everyone to climb higher. If someone trusts them, they&apos;ve already lost. Tomik treats the unit insignia like a necessary part of life. A blank wall? Unacceptable. An untouched case? Needs a mark. Whether it&apos;s subtle or elaborate, they find a way to leave the company&apos;s insignia on everything they work with. </personalityDescription>
