			<personalityDescription>There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Ethan. He grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if he stops moving, he might have to face what he&apos;s lost along the way. Ethan doesn&apos;t get involved unless he has to. Other people&apos;s problems, moral dilemmas, or even the bigger picture don&apos;t concern him - he focuses on what directly affects him and ignores the rest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;br&gt;- Does the job. Doesn&apos;t care who signs the check.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
