			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Steve is already halfway through it. He thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Steve&apos;s clumsiness isn&apos;t a joke to him - it&apos;s a source of constant frustration. He&apos;s tired of being the one who causes problems, tired of hearing the sighs when something crashes to the floor behind him. &quot;I don&apos;t need people to laugh it off. I need to stop screwing things up.&quot; </personalityDescription>
