			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To Ratislav, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In his world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. Ratislav has an uncanny ability to disappear from dangerous, awkward, or annoying situations. He&apos;s the first one to duck out of a failing meeting, the one who always finds the shortest line, the best exit, the quickest solution. &quot;I don&apos;t run. I strategically disengage.&quot; </personalityDescription>
