			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Sabra, the kind that makes people listen when she speaks and follow when she leads. She doesn&apos;t need to prove herself - she already knows where she stands. Sabra views war as a puzzle, and people as pieces to be moved. Emotions don&apos;t factor into her decisions - only efficiency and effectiveness. If sacrificing a few pawns guarantees her success, she won&apos;t hesitate to make the call. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t posture - just leads. Speaks, and others follow without question.&lt;br&gt;- Cold-blooded tactician. Will trade lives like poker chips.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
