			<personalityDescription>Once Markus commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake his resolve once he&apos;s made up his mind. Markus lies as easily as he breathes. Manipulation, deception, and outright betrayal are just tools in his arsenal, used to control those too naive to see through his carefully crafted facade. </personalityDescription>
