			<personalityDescription>Icim will do whatever it takes to survive and profit. She switches sides when the money&apos;s right, abandons allies if the deal goes sour, and never lets sentiment get in the way of a paycheck. If someone wants loyalty, they&apos;d better pay extra. Crowds fuel her. Icim enjoys the spotlight, telling the best stories, leading the wildest celebrations, and making sure everyone is having a good time. If there&apos;s action, she&apos;s in the middle of it, keeping the momentum alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Switches sides mid-fight if the payout shifts. Not to be trusted without a signed contract.&lt;br&gt;- Turns strangers into comrades before the first drinks gone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
