			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Marie would rather go down in flames than play it safe. She lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy she can get - and somehow, she usually pulls it off. Marie doesn&apos;t just keep up - she stays ahead. She spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrill-seeker. Battlefield is their playground. Somehow survives - so far.&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
