			<personalityDescription>Vjekoslava makes decisions in the heat of the moment, trusting gut instinct over careful planning. Whether in battle or conversation, she acts first and thinks later - sometimes to great effect, sometimes to great regret. Vjekoslava moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze her - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. She does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Gut-driven. Acts fast, sometimes smart - sometimes not. Unpredictable asset.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt flinch, doesnt linger - just keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
