			<personalityDescription>Albert doesn&apos;t waste time on sentiment - he does what it takes to win. Morality, loyalty, and fairness are just obstacles, and he has no patience for those too weak to do what&apos;s necessary. Albert has a number for everything. If something has happened before, been studied, or analyzed, he knows the probability of it happening again - and he will bring it up. &quot;Based on historical trends, there&apos;s a 41.67% chance this will fail exactly the same way as last time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Morals are roadblocks. Victory matters - nothing else.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
