			<personalityDescription>Meirul-Nisa lives in the now, always moving, always deciding on the fly. Whether it&apos;s a split-second gamble or an uncalculated risk, she thrives in the rush of immediate action - consequences can wait. Meirul-Nisa isn&apos;t dramatic about it, but she won&apos;t walk into a pitch-black space. If someone turns off the lights too soon, she&apos;s already reaching for a flashlight. &quot;I don&apos;t do pitch black. Shadows? Fine. But I want to see what&apos;s around me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
