			<personalityDescription>Greg has been battered, broken, and left for dead more times than they can count - but they&apos;re still here. Pain, loss, and suffering don&apos;t slow them down; they fuel them, turning every setback into another reason to keep fighting. Greg doesn&apos;t just enjoy passion - they command it. With a confident smirk and an irresistible charm, they draw others into their orbit, knowing exactly how to fuel the fire of desire and leave them wanting more. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pain fuels the fire. Still here, still fighting.&lt;br&gt;- Draws people in, burns hot, moves on. Makes allies - or mistakes - fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
