			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, José is already in motion. They don&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - José weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Briefings, budget reviews, deployment schedules - José listens, technically, but their notepad is always filled with little cartoons of their comrades, absurdly detailed &apos;Mek drawings, or a sketch of the commander looking way too serious. Half the company keeps their doodles as personal trophies. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through debate. Acts while others plan. Cold efficiency.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
