			<personalityDescription>In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Sumeyra refuses to become just another manipulator. They hold onto their integrity, even when it costs them, because they know that if they loses that, they&apos;ve lost everything. Sumeyra understands combat better than most people understand themselves. They can break down a skirmish like a music critic analyzing a symphony.&quot;That wasn&apos;t luck. That was timing, control, and a hell of a lot of practice.&quot; </personalityDescription>
