			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no middle ground with Jennifer - everything is turned up to eleven. She doesn&apos;t just prepare; she over-prepares. She doesn&apos;t just act; she goes all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, she hasn&apos;t found it yet. Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Jennifer - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. </personalityDescription>
