			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Abebi trusts no one. She watches every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, her constant vigilance has kept her alive this long. Abebi doesn&apos;t just have a rival - she has a fixation. A constant presence in her life that keeps her pushing forward, staying sharp, refusing to slip into complacency. Without that challenge, she&apos;s not sure she&apos;d know what to do with herself anymore. &quot;Without them, I don&apos;t know who I&apos;d be. And that scares me more than losing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 25%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one. Sees betrayal coming - or assumes it&apos;s already here.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
