			<personalityDescription>No matter how hardened the universe tries to make them, Jim refuses to shut themself off from others. They carry their burdens as if they were their own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. Jim doesn&apos;t expect thanks, doesn&apos;t make a scene, doesn&apos;t draw attention. If someone&apos;s struggling, they quietly cover for them. If a mistake needs fixing, they correct it before anyone notices. &quot;No need to mention it. Just... try not to screw up next time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
