			<personalityDescription>Experience and instinct guide Nejat&apos;s every move. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess - he just executes with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. Nejat struggles with routine but flourishes under pressure. If everything is calm and stable, he gets bored. But the moment things start falling apart, he snaps into focus. &quot;I swear, you only work properly when the whole system is burning down.&quot; Nejat grins. &quot;Well, yeah.&quot; </personalityDescription>
