			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Mar&apos;ya would rather go down in flames than play it safe. They live for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy they can get - and somehow, they usually pulls it off. Patience has never been Mar&apos;ya&apos;s strong suit. They lean forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, their restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - they live for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrill-seeker. Battlefield is their playground. Somehow survives - so far.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
