			<personalityDescription>Jovina doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer her something in return. Her survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Jovina doesn&apos;t just tell war stories - she lives them, relives them, makes them part of everything she does. She references past battles like they&apos;re life lessons, dropping names of people no one else remembers. To her, the past isn&apos;t just the past - it&apos;s the foundation of the present. </personalityDescription>
