			<personalityDescription>Gil doesn&apos;t coddle - he drives people forward. His words are sharp, his expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around him survive. If he&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because he refuses to let them fail. Gil refuses to let anything be left to chance. He&apos;s mapped out every possible outcome, every risk, and probably has a backup plan for his backup plan. No one argues with him anymore - not because they agree, but because he always wins. </personalityDescription>
