			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Arion would rather go down in flames than play it safe. He lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy he can get - and somehow, he usually pulls it off. Arion operates with a relentless sense of purpose, never allowing distractions or setbacks to pull him off course. Every failure is just another lesson, every victory another step toward his ultimate goal. </personalityDescription>
