			<personalityDescription>Most people call it bravery, but Ebere just calls it fun. She thrives on chaos, laughs in the face of danger, and treats every brush with death like just another story to tell over drinks. Ebere isn&apos;t cruel, but she doesn&apos;t see the point in getting emotionally invested. She makes decisions based on logic, not feelings, and while others may take things personally, she simply shrugs and moves on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Danger is entertainment. Laughs at risk. Borderline thrill-seeker.&lt;br&gt;- Shrugs off blood, blame, and bad calls. Keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
