			<personalityDescription>Rosemary&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. Rosemary never sits still. She shifts her stance, tugs at sleeves, readjusts posture - always moving, always slightly off-balance, like nothing ever feels fully settled. &quot;I&apos;m fine. Just... this shirt&apos;s wrong. Or maybe it&apos;s just me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past limits like they don&apos;t exist. Burnout risk? Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
