			<personalityDescription>Hoffman doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. He processes information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. Hoffman doesn&apos;t accept failure as an answer. If a situation looks unsalvageable, he doubles down, working harder, pushing past exhaustion until he finds a way. &quot;It&apos;s not impossible. We just haven&apos;t figured out how yet.&quot; </personalityDescription>
