			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Thian&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, he&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything he does is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Thian puts on a friendly face, but it&apos;s a survival tactic as much as anything. He knows being likable keeps people from turning on him, but deep down, he&apos;s always waiting for the moment when trust becomes a liability. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;br&gt;- Knows every name, every story. Makes people feel like they matter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
