			<personalityDescription>Arely never hesitates to take the lead, charging headfirst into danger with unshakable confidence. She believes that decisive action wins battles and refuses to back down, even when the odds are stacked against her. Arely is never caught off guard. She reads situations in real time, adjusts her strategy on the fly, and always has a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, she finds a way to turn the fight in her favor. </personalityDescription>
