			<personalityDescription>Tiarnán doesn&apos;t just fight to win - they fight to annihilate. Enemies aren&apos;t obstacles to be overcome; they&apos;re targets to be erased, and they won&apos;t stop until the battlefield is silent. Tiarnán&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. Their confidence is contagious, their words ignite courage, and their actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 80%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t just win - erases. Only satisfied when nothing is left alive.&lt;br&gt;- Rallies troops with words and actions. No false bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
