			<personalityDescription>Geertruijda doesn&apos;t waste time with hesitation - once a decision is made, she commits fully. On the battlefield, she acts with precision and confidence, knowing that in the chaos of war, a fast decision is often better than a perfect one. Experience and instinct guide Geertruijda&apos;s every move. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess - she just executes with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commits fast, no waffling. Values momentum over precision. Trusts instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t flinch. Just acts - and it works.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
