				<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
				<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Kenzie like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. She fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Kenzie believes in results, not feelings. She dismisses emotions as distractions and refuses to waste time comforting others. To her, facts, logic, and action matter - sympathy does not. </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- No room for grief. Moves on before the body hits the ground.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
